_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#migration","content":"路径参数保留 `+`；query 表单解码仍转为空格。Proxy 逐段编码，连接上游前拒绝越出 target 目录的请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1196":{"id":"/docs/development-server-52","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#migration","content":"FS base/intercept 和 Static root 都表示目录。include 将子条目作用域设为各配置文件所在目录，CLI 客体与 HMR 共用。`hmr.base` 改为 `intercept.fs.baseUrl`；原生 watch 仍接受原生路径，HTTP 客户端 base URL 保持普通 URL 语义。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1197":{"id":"/docs/development-server-53","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#migration","content":"`Resolver::resolve` 新增 `&Context` 参数，移除 tree 的 `base_dir` API。Rust effect 只开始一次清理，重复调用等待 setup/cleanup 并共享错误，丢弃句柄不取消清理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1198":{"id":"/docs/development-server-54","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#migration","content":"保留默认手动、限速自动重试和宿主自定义恢复；无论策略如何，无关插件必须持续运行。没有新增 JS 生产包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1199":{"id":"/docs/development-server-55","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#evidence","content":"Rust CI #43709794937 在 `aa14386` 上三平台全部通过，覆盖完整 workspace、故障/恢复测试、无默认 feature 检查、clippy、格式与架构。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1200":{"id":"/docs/development-server-56","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#evidence","content":"本次同步：手动触发的 Server reference #43709881683 在 `aa14386` 上通过 Linux、Windows、macOS。双端对照 Linux/macOS 各 224 用例、Windows 226 用例；Windows 同时运行了上游盘符专项。JS CI #43709794978 在同提交通过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1201":{"id":"/docs/development-server-57","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#evidence","content":"本地相关 Rust 套件、workspace/all-target clippy、架构与格式检查通过；网站类型检查和 41 个测试通过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1202":{"id":"/docs/development-server-58","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#历史验收记录","content":"历史基线：最初实现 CI #43705092966 的六个平台任务全部成功，绑定 `3226312`；同提交 JS CI #43705092953 成功。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1203":{"id":"/docs/development-server-59","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#历史验收记录","content":"本机 `cargo test --workspace`、workspace clippy、fmt、arch、loader 无默认 feature 测试/clippy，以及 HMR process feature clippy 全部通过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1204":{"id":"/docs/development-server-60","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#历史验收记录","content":"首次 FS Windows 验收发现父路径为文件时系统返回 NotFound，而 Unix 返回 NotADirectory。测试改为原生期望，随后 CI #43700024799 成功；错误映射没有被掩盖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1205":{"id":"/docs/development-server-61","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#历史验收记录","content":"Static 首轮 macOS 的既有 include rename watcher 超时；同一提交仅重跑失败任务后 CI #43700396222 成功。最终提交再次完整通过三平台。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1206":{"id":"/docs/development-server-62","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#历史验收记录","content":"本地旧 xtask 二进制曾内嵌仓库改名前的路径；仅清理该包编译缓存后，架构及完整 workspace 再次通过，没有修改断言。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1207":{"id":"/docs/development-server-63","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#历史验收记录","content":"被后续推送取消的中间 CI 不作为成功证据。原生 CI runner 不等于用户个人设备验收；本轮未执行用户个人设备独立测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1208":{"id":"/docs/development-server-64","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#boundaries","content":"保留实测上游细节，包括返回 Response 丢弃自定义 reason、Proxy 最后一个 Set-Cookie、提供者上下文的 proxy publicUrl、错误页不同于普通文件的路径规则。详细契约见参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1209":{"id":"/docs/development-server-65","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#boundaries","content":"Rust 使用类型化回调/服务和 UTF-8/serde 值，不重建整个 JS 对象模型。HTTP 辅助服务只覆盖 HTTP(S)/WS(S) raw transport、配置及生命周期；没有完整 decoder/file/data/SOCKS 生态，WS 客户端不提出 permessage-deflate。FS 扩展为 provider 只读流，保留已有 watch，没有增加写入生态。五个目标插件有实际生产实现，未另建五套 JS 产品或 guest 网络协议。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1210":{"id":"/docs/development-server-66","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#boundaries","content":"后续更换上游 SHA 时，先记录版本差异、更新共享场景，再生成映射、运行三平台对照和故障矩阵。所有规则、样本来源和可复现命令应保持长期可查；不要用“编译成功”或一次宿主重启替代隔离验收。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1211":{"id":"/docs/development-status","page_id":"/docs/development-status","type":"page","content":"状态与偏离","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-status","locale":"zh-CN"},"1212":{"id":"/docs/development-status-0","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status","content":"kardia 的实现阶段及其退出标准、实现状态，以及实现偏离计划或 TypeScript 代码的每一处。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1213":{"id":"/docs/development-status-1","page_id":"/docs/development-status","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-status#phases","content":"实现阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"1214":{"id":"/docs/development-status-2","page_id":"/docs/development-status","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-status#status","content":"实现状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"1215":{"id":"/docs/development-status-3","page_id":"/docs/development-status","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"偏离","locale":"zh-CN"},"1216":{"id":"/docs/development-status-4","page_id":"/docs/development-status","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-status#errors","content":"错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"1217":{"id":"/docs/development-status-5","page_id":"/docs/development-status","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-status#loader-hooks","content":"加载器钩子","locale":"zh-CN"},"1218":{"id":"/docs/development-status-6","page_id":"/docs/development-status","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-status#dynamic-modules","content":"动态模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"1219":{"id":"/docs/dev