viations","content":"主题","locale":"zh-CN"},"1262":{"id":"/docs/development-status-50","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"实现","locale":"zh-CN"},"1263":{"id":"/docs/development-status-51","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"已退役的提供者","locale":"zh-CN"},"1264":{"id":"/docs/development-status-52","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"由属性测试发现：退役一个纤程会立即解除其存活的提供，因此后继者可以在同一领域中提供服务，而旧的消费者仍在排空（它们通过自己的已提交视图读取）。TS 代码会一直保留该槽位直到排空结束，并使后继者失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1265":{"id":"/docs/development-status-53","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"过期的加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"1266":{"id":"/docs/development-status-54","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"已退役纤程仍在进行中的加载可以注册逆操作（因此它获取的任何东西都不会泄漏），但不能注册提供。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1267":{"id":"/docs/development-status-55","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"排空期间移除提供","locale":"zh-CN"},"1268":{"id":"/docs/development-status-56","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"推迟到提供者排空结束时，这样后代在自身清理期间仍能访问继承的服务，而无需依赖微任务的顺序。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1269":{"id":"/docs/development-status-57","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"可重新指向的上下文","locale":"zh-CN"},"1270":{"id":"/docs/development-status-58","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"作用域节点携带其纤程；一次访问的纤程链从派生链上读出，因此移动一个条目也会移动它下面的纤程（TS 原型的行为）。条目表是可变的 `Overlay` 节点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1271":{"id":"/docs/development-status-59","page