],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"由于生命周期被写成纯粹的临界区（并发），测试中可以用一个**确定性调度器**驱动核心：一个测试框架把派生出的转换放在队列中，由 `proptest` 选择下一个推进的可运行任务。使用效应为写入一张共享表（每次写入都有精确的逆操作）的合成组件，随机的编排序列（insert / retire / provide / withdraw / update）和随机的调度会检查元理论中的定理：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1379":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-36","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"性质","locale":"zh-CN"},"1380":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-37","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"定理","locale":"zh-CN"},"1381":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-38","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"检查方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"1382":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-39","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"**保持性**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1383":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-40","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"Thm 64","locale":"zh-CN"},"1384":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-41","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"每一步之后注册表都是良构的（父纤程存在、每个领域（realm）内的提供互不相交、已提交视图（committed view）指向已安装的纤程）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1385":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-42","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"**恢复精确性**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1386":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-43","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"Thm 68 / Cor 69","locale":"zh-CN"},"1387":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-44","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"一个纤程的生命周期片段（episode）关闭后，表等于去掉该纤程各步骤之后的运行结果；被移除纤程的提供为空。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1388":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-45","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"**顺序性**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1389":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-46","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"Thm 70","locale":"zh-CN"},"1390":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-47","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"提供者的生命周期片段严格包含每个已提交到它的消费者的生命周期片段；没有消费者会在其提供者的生命周期片段之外读取绑定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1391":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-48","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"**解析一致性**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1392":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-49","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"Thm 71","locale":"zh-CN"},"1393":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-50","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"每次 `apply` 都只观察到一个已提交视图。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1394":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-51","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"**进展性**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1395":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-52","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"Thm 73","locale":"zh-CN"},"1396":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-53","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"每个调度都在步数上限内到达静止状态（声明无环时）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1397":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-54","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"**合流性**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1398":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-55","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"Thm 80","locale":"zh-CN"},"1399":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-56","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"对于固定的编排输入，所有调度都会到达相同的 `Active` 纤程集合（= 支撑集 A），以及在纤程重命名意义下相同的表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1400":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-57","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"这些测试依据理论检查实现，没有把任何业务逻辑复制到测试中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1401":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-58","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#model-based","content":"实际实现（`crates/kardia-core/tests/model.rs`）中，属性测试以带随机延迟的真实 tokio 调度驱动，而不是确定性调度器。它们在每次运行期间检查顺序性，并在静止时检查保持性、恢复精确性和合流性（活跃纤程恰好是支撑集）。属性测试还发现了已退役提供者的偏离。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1402":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-59","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#unit-tests","content":"纯模块（`IdTable`、`Scope` 查找、目标计算、`journal`、`patch`、glob 谓词、HMR 并查集）有针对性的单元测试。mock 仅限于 `Catalog`/`ModuleSource` 测试注册表和注入故障的文件系统垫片。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1403":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-60","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#tooling","content":"`cargo fmt`、`cargo clippy -D warnings`、`cargo test --workspace`（CI 的确切命令见参与开发）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1404":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-61","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#tooling","content":"`unsafe` 仅限于 dylib 后端的 FFI（`kardia-hmr/src/dylib.rs`）和访客 SDK（`kardia-guest/src/ffi.rs`）；其他所有 crate 都禁止使用它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1405":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-62","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#tooling","content":"*不*计划引入可选的 `loom`：单锁设计没有需要建模的无锁状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1406":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-63","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#server","content":"五个 Server 包有 105 项原始上游声明和 201 项真实补充/双端测试，在 Linux、Windows、macOS 验证。覆盖完整 MIME 样本、TLS、WS、CLI 集成以及三种恢复策略下无关插件持续运行。见复现命令与证据；清单和 MIME 源码通过现有脚本生成，不手改。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1407":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-64","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#js-recovery","content":"`js.yml` 在 Linux、Windows、macOS 分别执行包类型检查、测试、构建，以及真实 Rust 子进程 bridge E2E。它验证 JS 与 Rust 各自的恢复策略，不依赖上游 Server 对照工作流。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1408":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-65","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#js-recovery","content":"本地验收：14 个 JS 测试文件、155 项测试，10 项真实跨端 E2E；Rust bridge 11 项测试、clippy、fmt 与架构检查通过。新增验收包括：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1409":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-66","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#js-recovery","content":"core 17 项：三种策略下反复失效、清理完成后恢复、无关插件持续进展；默认手动、加载失败、配置错误不重试、宿主处理函数抛错/拒绝、策略切换和卸载取消过期决定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1410":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-67","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#js-recovery","content":"timer 15 项：四种调度器捕获同步异常/异步拒绝、日志归属、卸载等待回调结束；三种策略下显式实例故障反复恢复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1411":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-68","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#js-recovery","content":"bridge 新增 5 项：实际 Rust 提供者分别执行三轮 manual/retry/host 恢复，JS 消费者随服务撤销/重新暴露停止和启动；独立 Rust/JS 调用及定时进展不中断，不重启 bridge；另测 retry/host 的移除取消。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1412":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-69","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#js-recovery","content":"既有部分单元测试使用假定时器；新增故障测试使用真实计时器和实现，E2E 使用真实子进程通信。原生 CI 不等于用户个人设备、浏览器或 Tauri webview 的独立实机验收。恢复策略与同线程隔离限制见使用指南。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1413":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-70","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#js-recovery","content":"本轮原生验收：JS #43707771734 在提交 `3b67c40` 的六个任务全部通过（三平台各 155 项包测试、五包构建及 10 项 E2E）。Rust CI #43707335399 在 `fd1a6e3` 的三平台任务通过；之后只修改 JS 监督、测试与文档，Rust 源码未变。网站 #43707771760 完成类型检查、41 项测试、全量构建与发布。本轮没有升级版本或发布 npm/crates 包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1414":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-71","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#js-recovery","content":"原生验证曾发现 Windows 构建脚本手工拼接路径导致 LICENSE 复制失败，现已使用系统路径与可移植编译器启动方式。跨端夹具也修正了 Windows 退出请求未排空导致的 EPIPE，以及 macOS 将初次就绪前重试误计入故障观察的问题；故障期间不重连、独立进展和资源清理断言仍保留。被后续推送取消的中间运行不计为验收通过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1415":{"id":"/docs/development","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"page","content":"Rust 设计","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development","locale":"zh-CN"},"1416":{"id":"/docs/development-0","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development","content":"kardia（Cordis 的 Rust 实现）的设计：目标、从论文到 Rust 的概念对应，以及 crate 布局。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1417":{"id":"/docs/development-1","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development#goals","content":"目标、非目标与指导决策","locale":"zh-CN"},"1418":{"id":"/docs/development-2","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development#goals-list","content":"目标","locale":"zh-CN"},"1419":{"id":"/docs/development-3","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development#non-goals","content":"非目标（针对最初的几个版本）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1420":{"id":"/docs/development-4","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"指导决策","locale":"zh-CN"},"1421":{"id":"/docs/development-5","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[]