算**（论文 §4）：纤程（fiber）、目标视图与已提交视图（committed view）、卸载时的守卫、惯性（inertia）、失败结果、每个（键，领域（realm））只有单一来源、合流性。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1440":{"id":"/docs/development-24","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#goals-list","content":"在论文未作规定之处，**在行为上与 Cordis 核心保持一致**（带修订号的纪元（epoch）、两级守卫、纤程级的并发释放、`update` 否决、`replace`），以 TypeScript 测试套件作为验收规范。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1441":{"id":"/docs/development-25","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#goals-list","content":"**地道的 Rust**：带类型的服务键、以显式的调用者归属代替 `Proxy`、可在多线程 tokio 运行时中使用的 `Send + Sync` 句柄、核心中没有 `unsafe`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1442":{"id":"/docs/development-26","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#goals-list","content":"声明式的**加载器**（条目、分组、领域），以及基于文件、双向同步的 **include**（配置文件引入）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1443":{"id":"/docs/development-27","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#non-goals","content":"在运行时重新求值插件*代码*（HMR）。Rust 没有模块注册表；这会成为一个可选的、后续的“模块来源”扩展（加载器内部）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1444":{"id":"/docs/development-28","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#non-goals","content":"npm 专用的工具（`package-manager`、`create`、`loader-utils`）。不移植。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1445":{"id":"/docs/development-29","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#non-goals","content":"错误消息与 UTF-16 列号逐字节一致（有更好，但不要求）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1446":{"id":"/docs/development-30","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#non-goals","content":"HMR 只是最初几个版本的非目标。它后来已在 `kardia-hmr` 中实现（WASM、dylib 与进程后端，以及监视模式）；见状态与偏离。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1447":{"id":"/docs/development-31","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"以下为摘要；每项决策的理由见最后一列链接的页面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1448":{"id":"/docs/development-32","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"#","locale":"zh-CN"},"1449":{"id":"/docs/development-33","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"决策","locale":"zh-CN"},"1450":{"id":"/docs/development-34","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"章节","locale":"zh-CN"},"1451":{"id":"/docs/development-35","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"D1","locale":"zh-CN"},"1452":{"id":"/docs/development-36","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"`Send + Sync` 的核心；每个根一把状态锁；**持锁期间不运行任何用户代码**；JS 中的每个“同步段”变成一个临界区；后续工作以动作列表返回，在解锁后执行","locale":"zh-CN"},"1453":{"id":"/docs/development-37","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"并发","locale":"zh-CN"},"1454":{"id":"/docs/development-38","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"D2","locale":"zh-CN"},"1455":{"id":"/docs/development-39","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"纤程存放在注册表的 arena 中，以永不复用的 `FiberId` 寻址；所有交叉引用（父纤程、依赖者、已提交视图）都是 id，而不是指针","locale":"zh-CN"},"1456":{"id":"/docs/development-40","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"核心数据结构","locale":"zh-CN"},"1457":{"id":"/docs/development-41","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"D3","locale":"zh-CN"},"1458":{"id":"/docs/development-42","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"服务键是**字符串**（配置需要用它命名服务），通过 `Service` trait 绑定到一个 **Rust 类型**；值以 `Arc<dyn Any + Send + Sync>` 加上它的 `TypeId` 存储（用于检测键冲突）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1459":{"id":"/docs/development-43","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"1460":{"id":"/docs/development-44","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"D4","locale":"zh-CN"},"1461":{"id":"/docs/development-45","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"通过显式的 `Svc<S>` 句柄 =（服务 `Arc`，调用者 `Context`）实现调用者归属；服务保留自己定义处的 `Context`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1462":{"id":"/docs/development-46","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"调用者归属","locale":"zh-CN"},"1463":{"id":"/docs/development-47","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"D5","locale":"zh-CN"},"1464":{"id":"/docs/development-48","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"效应（effect）注册在当前纤程的累积器上；撤销函数（disposer）是 `FnOnce`（由类型系统保证至多执行一次）；`EffectHandle` 在 `Drop` 时**不会**释放","locale":"zh-CN"},"1465":{"id":"/docs/development-49","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"效应","locale":"zh-CN"},"1466":{"id":"/docs/development-50","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"D6","locale":"zh-CN"},"1467":{"id":"/docs/development-51","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"异步转换是**惯性的**：正在执行的 `apply` future 永不丢弃；转向只发生在显式的检查点（`ctx.checkpoint().await?`、`scope.yield_(d).await?`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1468":{"id":"/docs/development-52","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"中断","locale":"zh-CN"},"1469":{"id":"/docs/development-53","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"D7","locale":"zh-CN"},"1470":{"id":"/docs/development-54","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"te