s/development-146","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#layout","content":"仓库根目录下的一个 Cargo 工作区，旁边是未改动的 `cordis/` 参考代码（TypeScript 源码的本地检出，被 git 忽略）、`examples/`、`docs/`，以及位于 `site/` 的文档站点：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1563":{"id":"/docs/development-147","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#layout","content":"计划中的树为绑定列出了 `store.rs`，为 `FiberData` 列出了 `fiber.rs`；在代码中，绑定和纤程数据位于 `state.rs`（provide / withdraw / get 在 `service.rs` 中），而 `context.rs`、`deps.rs` 和 `id_table.rs` 是单独的模块。上面的树以仓库现状为准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1564":{"id":"/docs/development-148","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#dependencies","content":"crate 之间的依赖方向与 TS 包一致：`core ← timer, logger-console, fs ← loader ← include, hmr ← kardia (facade)`；`hmr` 的监视模式还会用到 `fs`，而 `kardia-guest` 不依赖其中任何一个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1565":{"id":"/docs/development-149","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#dependencies","content":"图中画的是各 `Cargo.toml` 中的直接依赖。上面那条链表示分层，并不是直接依赖的列表：`kardia-loader` 只依赖 `kardia-core`（不依赖 `timer`、`logger-console` 或 `fs`），而 `kardia-include` 与 `kardia-hmr` 各自依赖 `core`、`loader` 和 `fs`。门面 crate 依赖除 `kardia-guest` 以外的所有其他 crate；`kardia-macros` 不依赖任何 kardia crate（它的测试使用 `kardia-core`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1566":{"id":"/docs/development-150","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#external-dependencies","content":"刻意保持精简；每一行都说明了为什么需要它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1567":{"id":"/docs/development-151","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#external-dependencies","content":"Crate","locale":"zh-CN"},"1568":{"id":"/docs/development-152","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#external-dependencies","content":"使用者","locale":"zh-CN"},"1569":{"id":"/docs/development-153","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#external-dep