de-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#entry-fields","content":"插件所用服务的元数据，按服务分键。例如 `logger: { name: db, level: 3 }`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1651":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#entry-fields","content":"`isolate`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1652":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#entry-fields","content":"给服务一个独立的作用域：`{ db: true }` 让 `db` 成为该条目私有，`{ db: shared }` 让所有使用标签 `shared` 的条目共享它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1653":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#entry-fields","content":"条目在读取时校验，规则很少：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1654":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#entry-fields","content":"**`id`** 是字符串，且不能包含 `:`（加载器（loader）用 `:` 连接跨 include（配置文件引入）文件的 id）。缺失的 id 在读取文件时生成：八位十六进制数字。在下一次读取时内容未变的匿名条目会保留其 id，因此编辑相邻条目不会让它重启。生成的 id 随下一次写回进入文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1655":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#entry-fields","content":"**`name`** 必填。不是内置插件名的名字是访客模块路径，相对于配置文件：`.wasm` 或 `.wat` 表示 WebAssembly，其他扩展名表示动态库。见访客插件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1656":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#entry-fields","content":"**`config`** 可以是任意值，由插件自行解码。分组（`group: true`）的 `config` 必须是条目列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1657":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#entry-fields","content":"**`group`** 是布尔值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1658":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"