ts#update","content":"若纤程已加载，先校验新配置；被拒绝的配置会返回错误，运行中的实例不受影响。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1986":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-147","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#update","content":"除非设置了 `no_save`，发出 `ConfigCommitted { fiber, config }`（加载器据此把它回写到配置文件）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1987":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-148","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#update","content":"保存配置，并清除纤程的错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1988":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-149","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#update","content":"把解码后的配置交给纤程的更新钩子（`ctx.on_update`、`ctx.on_update_with`）。接管更新的钩子决定更新如何完成，纤程不会重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1989":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-150","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#update","content":"否则纤程重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1990":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-151","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#update","content":"**`restart()`** 递增纤程的修订号，使它以相同配置卸载并重新加载。对已退役的纤程会失败；它也不能恢复 `Failed` 的纤程：在 `update` 或 `registry.replace` 清除错误之前，失败一直保留（`settled()` 也一直返回它）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1991":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-152","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#update","content":"**`fail(error)`** 从外部使纤程失败，效果与加载返回 `error` 相同：纤程卸载，撤销其副作用和提供的服务，并以该错误停留在 `Failed`，直到 `update` 或 `registry.replace` 清除它。正在进行的加载会先完成；已经失败的纤程保留它的第一个错误。宿主用它报告 `apply` 之后发生的失败，例如退出的访客进程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1992":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-153","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#update","content":"**`dispose()`** 让纤程退役：它被标为已移除，现存的提供立即解除绑定，然后卸载并稳定为 `Disposed`。对根纤程而言，`dispose()` 会重启根，撤销登记在其上的一切；应用就是这样关闭的：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1993":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-154","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#replace","content":"`ctx.registry()` 用于访问根的插件注册表：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1994":{