docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"每个版本从一份新副本加载，**永不卸载**；一直保留到进程退出","locale":"zh-CN"},"2039":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"重载模块会重新启动其进程","locale":"zh-CN"},"2040":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"适用于","locale":"zh-CN"},"2041":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"生产环境的访客","locale":"zh-CN"},"2042":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"开发：同一套工具链，无需 WASM 目标","locale":"zh-CN"},"2043":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"任意语言编写的访客，或不能让宿主崩溃的访客","locale":"zh-CN"},"2044":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"`kardia` 二进制","locale":"zh-CN"},"2045":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"支持","locale":"zh-CN"},"2046":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"支持","locale":"zh-CN"},"2047":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"暂不支持（仅限库）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2048":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"**WebAssembly。** `WasmSource` 在 wasmtime 上运行核心 WebAssembly 模块，而不是 WIT 组件，因此访客不需要组件工具链（测试用 WAT 编写）。模块每个版本编译一次，并为每个纤程在各自的 store 中实例化。`WasmSource::with_limits` 为每个实例设置上限：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2049":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"燃料或时间耗尽的导出会触发陷阱（trap），该实例之后的调用以 `the guest was stopped: …` 失败；内存增长超过上限也会触发陷阱。设置了时间上限时，调用者自己的截止时间（`call_timeout`、`call_async`）同样生效。`WasmSource::new()` 不设置任何上限。这些失败都是带类型的 `GuestFailure`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2050":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"要像 `ProcessGuest::plugin` 那样从外部给出 WASM 插件的元数据，可以把模块编译为 `WasmGuest`：`WasmGuest::new(bytes, limits)` 在自己的引擎上编译 WASM 字节或 WAT 文本，`source.guest(bytes)` 则在某个 `WasmSource` 的引擎上、按它的上限编译。两者都不实例化模块。`plugin(meta)` 生成插件，每个实例启动时必须声明相同的元数据；`module(id)` 则像 `WasmSource` 那样从一个实例中读取元数据。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2051":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"**macOS 上的陷阱处理**。在 macOS 上，wasmtime 默认通过 Mach 异常端口处理 WASM 陷阱。它的陷阱处理器是进程级的：wasmtime 在创建第一个引擎时安装它，之后的引擎若要求另一种设置，wasmtime 会 panic。`kardia::hmr::set_macos_mach_ports(false)` 让 kardia-hmr 创建的每个引擎改用 Unix 信号。请在创建第一个 `WasmSource` 或 `WasmGuest` 之前调用它：此后再要求另一种设置会返回错误，且不改变任何东西。应用自己用 wasmtime 创建的引擎必须使用相同的设置。在 macOS 以外的平台上，这个调用不改变任何东西。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2052":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"**动态库。** `DylibSource` 使用 C ABI，而不是传递 Rust 类型：`cdylib` 自带一份 `kardia-core` 和 tokio，静态变量各自独立，也没有运行时上下文。每次加载都会把库复制到一个新路径（位于临时目录下的 `kardia-dylib-<pid>` 目录中），因为平台加载器对已知路径会直接交出已加载的那个库。库永不卸载：一旦 Rust 代码注册了线程局部析构函数或交出了 `'static` 引用，卸载它就是不健全的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2053":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"**子进程。** `ProcessSource` 把每个插件实例作为独立进程运行，通过 stdin 和 stdout 以 JSON 行的形式使用访客 ABI（见进程传输）。进程结束的访客只会让它自己的插件失败；破坏协议或超过调用截止时间的访客会被杀死。命令行参数、spawner、超时和退出报告见进程访客。替换可执行文件时，请把新文件重命名覆盖到原路径：正在运行的可执行文件不能被写入，而以写方式打开着的文件不能被启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2054":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"**三者的共同点。** `GuestService::call` 会阻塞调用者直到访客应答；`call_async` 则在异步工作线程之外执行调用，桥接插件执行 `apply` 和 `dispose` 时也是如此。截止时间可以终止进程访客（将其杀死）和设置了时间上限的 WASM 访客（触发陷阱）；dylib 访客运行在调用者的线程上，无法被终止。没有单独的代理（broker）服务：每个纤程的 `GuestService` 就是 RPC 端点。这些后端是 `kardia-hmr` 的 cargo 特性（`wasm`、`dylib`、`process`，默认全部开启）；另有 `preserve-order`（默认开启），它通过 `kardia-loader` 开启 `serde_json/preserve_order`，关闭它可让应用保留 serde_json 的默认映射（键顺序）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2055":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"`kardia` 二进制按文件扩展名选择后端：`.wasm` 和 `.wat` 交给 `WasmSource`，其他一律交给 `DylibSource`。基于库构建的应用可以自行选择：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2056":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"访客通过 `Host::provide` 提供服务。在宿主一侧，每个这样的服务都是一个 `kardia::hmr::GuestService`，其 JSON 视图就是访客提供的值：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2057":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`GuestService`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2058":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`value()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2059":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"访客提供该服务时给出的 JSON 值","locale":"zh-CN"},"2060":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`call(method, args)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2061":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"以 `{ key, method, args }` 调用访客的 `cordis_call`，返回其 JSON 结果；阻塞直到访客应答，或直到访客的默认超时","locale":"zh-CN"},"2062":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`call_timeout(method, args, timeout)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2063":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"与 `call` 相同，但超过 `timeout` 后以 `the guest did not answer in time` 失败；此时进程访客会被杀死，之后的调用也会失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"2064":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`call_async(method, args, timeout)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2065":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"在异步工作线程之外执行调用，可设置超时；丢弃该 future 即取消调用（`kardia-guest/2` 访客会收到通知，其结果被丢弃）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2066":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`is_available()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2067":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"实例是否仍能应答：未被释放，且其进程没有退出","locale":"zh-CN"},"2068":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`handle()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2069":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"进程访客的 `GuestHandle`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2070":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"提供该服务的纤程消失后，调用以 `the guest instance is disposed` 失败；进程访客自行结束后，以 `the guest process exited` 失败；访客返回的不是 JSON 时，以 `invalid result of <key>.<method>: …` 失败。访客回调到一个已在同一线程上运行的实例（直接或经由其他访客）时，会以 `re-entrant call into a guest instance` 失败，而不会死锁。与任何服务一样，访客的纤程被释放时，访客服务随之撤回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2071":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"`ProcessSource` 把模块 id 当作程序运行，不带参数。`ProcessGuest` 描述一条访客命令及其选项；可以直接使用，也可以在你自己的 `ModuleSource` 中使用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2072":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"`ProcessGuest`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2073":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"`new(command)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2074":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"运行 `command` 的访客（`GuestCommand`：程序、`arg`/`args`、`env`、`current_dir`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2075":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"`spawner(spawner)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2076":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"由谁启动它的进程（见下文）；默认为 `StdSpawner`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2077":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"`timeout(duration)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2078":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"调用者未设置截止时间时，每次导出可用的时长；超过后进程被杀死。默认没有，但此时 `dispose` 限定为 5 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"2079":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"`handshake_timeout(duration)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2080":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"访客应答握手的时限（默认 10 秒）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2081":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"`frame_limit(bytes)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2082":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"访客可发送的最长一行（默认 16 MiB）；更长的一行会使访客被杀死","locale":"zh-CN"},"2083":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"`plugin(meta)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2084":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"访客的插件，其 `GuestMeta`（`new(name)`、`.inject(key)`、`.provide(key)`）由调用者给出。每个进程启动时必须声明相同的元数据（相同的名称，以及顺序不限的相同服务），否则其纤程失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"2085":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"`module(id)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2086":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"访客的模块，其元数据从为此启动的进程中读取","locale":"zh-CN"},"2087":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#spawner","content":"`Spawner` 负责启动进程，由应用决定访客如何运行（沙箱、进程组、拥有它的进程管理器）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2088":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#spawner","content":"它得到命令的程序、参数、环境变量和工作目录（`get_program`、`get_args`、`get_envs`、`get_current_dir`，或用 `to_std()` 得到 `std::process::Command`），并返回一个 `GuestProcess`：进程的 stdin 和 stdout，可选的 stderr（`.stderr(…)`，用于退出报告），以及一个 `GuestChild`，即实例在进程结束前一直持有的控制句柄（`id`、`kill`、`try_wait`、`wait`，与 `std::process::Child` 相同）。`GuestProcess::from_child` 接受以管道方式启动 stdio 的 `std::process::Child`。默认的 `StdSpawner` 用 `std::process` 在应用的环境加上命令的变量中运行命令。实例用完进程时（释放时，或访客失败时）会杀死它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2089":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"每个进程访客都有一个 `GuestHandle`，可从 `GuestService::handle()` 或 `GuestStarted` 事件获得：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2090":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"`GuestHandle`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2091":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"`id()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2092":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"spawner 报告的进程 id","locale":"zh-CN"},"2093":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-91","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"`protocol()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2094":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-92","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"访客使用的协议：`1` 或 `2`（`kardia-guest/2`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2095":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-93","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"`exit()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2096":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-94","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"进程结束后的 `GuestExit` 报告","locale":"zh-CN"},"2097":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-95","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"`subscribe()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2098":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-96","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"报告的 `tokio::sync::watch` 接收端（进程运行期间为 `None`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2099":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-97","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"`exited()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2100":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-98","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"以报告完成的 future","locale":"zh-CN"},"2101":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-99","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"`stderr_tail()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2102":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-100","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"进程迄今写入 stderr 的最后 16 KiB","locale":"zh-CN"},"2103":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-101","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"`kill()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2104":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-102","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"杀死进程；其报告注明 `killed by the host`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2105":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-103","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"`ping(timeout)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2106":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-104","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"检查 `kardia-guest/2` 访客是否应答，即使它正在执行调用；以往返时间完成","locale":"zh-CN"},"2107":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-105","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"`GuestExit` 包含退出状态 `status`、原因 `cause`（`ExitCause::Exited` 为自行退出，`Killed(reason)` 为错过截止时间、违反协议或 `kill()`，`Disposed` 为被其纤程释放）以及 `stderr_tail`（16 KiB）。stderr 的每一行也会以插件的身份在 `debug` 级别记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2108":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-106","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"桥接插件会在访客的纤程上发出两个事件：进程启动后、`apply` 之前发出 `GuestStarted { fiber, handle }`；进程在纤程释放它之前结束时发出 `GuestExited { fiber, exit }`。随后纤程以该报告为错误失败（`Fiber::fail`），撤回它的服务，其使用者会重新等待这些服务。与任何失败的纤程一样，`restart` 会让它保持失败；`fiber.update(config)` 会启动一个新进程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2109":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-107","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#transports","content":"各后端实现了两个公开 trait，宿主可以为自己的传输实现它们：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2110":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-108","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#transports","content":"`GuestCode::instantiate(&self, host: GuestHost) -> Result<Box<dyn GuestInstance>>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2111":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-109","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#transports","content":"启动一个实例，其宿主调用作用于 `host`（`log`、`provide`、`view`、`invoke`）；在异步工作线程之外调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2112":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-110","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#transports","content":"`GuestInstance::call(&mut self, export, input, control: &CallControl) -> Result<Vec<u8>>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2113":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-111","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#transports","content":"以 UTF-8 JSON 输入调用一个 `Export`（`Meta`、`Apply`、`Call`、`Dispose`），返回访客的输出或错误；应在 `control.deadline()` 时停止，并在 `control.is_cancelled()` 后丢弃结果（`on_cancel` 会唤醒它）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2114":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-112","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#transports","content":"`GuestInstance::handle(&self) -> Option<GuestHandle>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2115":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-113","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#transports","content":"背后的进程（如有；默认为 `None`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2116":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-114","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#transports","content":"`kardia::hmr::guest_module(id, code)` 把一个 `GuestCode` 变为模块代码，元数据从一个新实例中读取；`guest_plugin(code, meta)` 把它变为元数据由调用者给出的插件。`ProcessGuest` 和 `WasmGuest` 是进程后端和 WASM 后端的 `GuestCode`，它们的 `plugin(meta)` 和 `module(id)` 就是这两个函数。实例失败的传输应返回 `GuestFailure`，以