到条目 `parent` 的分组（`None` 表示根分组）中的 `position` 处（会被截断到有效范围；`None` 表示追加到末尾），然后启动它。分组条目在其插件加载时才创建分组，所以仍在加载中的 `parent` 会被等待。（来自文件或分组更新的条目改为浅层校验，每个分组成员在其分组调和它时校验；校验函数是 `kardia_loader::validate_options(&options, deep)`。）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2476":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-109","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"**`update(id, patch, parent, position)`** 把 `patch` 合并进选项（`null` 删除一个键），校验结果并应用。`parent: None` 表示条目留在原处；`Some(None)` 把它移到根分组，`Some(Some(id))` 把它移入条目 `id` 的分组，也可以跨树移动：移入另一棵树时，条目的分组成员会一起移动；若其中某个 id 在目标树中已存在，则移动失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2477":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-110","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"更新对运行中插件的影响取决于改了什么：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2478":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-111","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"`name` 或 `inject` 改变，或条目未在运行：重建条目（先释放它的纤程，再重新启动）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2479":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-112","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"否则就地修补运行中的纤程：条目连同新的隔离表被重新挂到它（新的）分组之下（重新挂接条目的上下文时，其下的所有纤程也随之移动，就像重新指向的 JavaScript 原型），`intercept` 原地替换，改变后的 `config` 以 `fiber.update_with(config, true)` 的形式到达插件，插件的更新钩子可以接管它而不重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2480":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-113","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"**`remove(id)`** 释放条目，并把它从所在分组中移除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2481":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-114","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"**回写。** 插件对自身的修改会到达它的条目：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2482":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-115","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"自行释放的插件被持久化为 `disabled: true`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2483":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-116","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"自行更新配置的插件（`fiber.update(..)`，它会发出 `ConfigCommitted`）会把新的 `config` 写入其条目；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2484":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-117","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"依赖丢失会卸载条目的外层纤程但不释放它；此后在外层纤程重新激活之前，条目被视为禁用，且不写入任何内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2485":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-118","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"应用到树上的每个变化都会在应用之后以 `EntryChange` 的形式报告给它的后端：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2486":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-119","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"`EntryChange` 字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"2487":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-120","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"2488":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-121","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"`id`、`group`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2489":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-122","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"条目的本地 id，以及它当前所在的分组","locale":"zh-CN"},"2490":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-123","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"没有 `options`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2491":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-124","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"条目已从 `group` 中移除","locale":"zh-CN"},"2492":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-125","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"没有 `legacy`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2493":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-126","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"条目是在 `group` 中新建的","locale":"zh-CN"},"2494":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-127","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"两者都有","l