ugins-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins","content":"用 Rust 编写的插件（plugin）会编译进你的应用。本页介绍如何声明服务（service）、编写提供和使用服务的插件、启动它们，以及让配置文件能够使用它们。API 为什么是这个样子，见 API 设计。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2614":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#add-the-dependency","content":"`use kardia::prelude::*;` 引入大多数插件需要的名字：`Context`、`Plugin`、`PluginDef`、`Inject`、`Injected`、`Service`、`Svc`、`Fiber`、`Result`、两个宏、定时器、`Loader`、`Deserialize` 和 `json!`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2615":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#a-first-example","content":"服务就是普通类型。`#[plugin]` 宏从插件的函数签名中读取它的依赖，因此访问未声明的服务会导致编译错误：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2616":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#a-first-example","content":"运行过程：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2617":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#a-first-example","content":"`greeter` 声明了 `database` 和 `timer`，在二者都可用之前一直处于等待状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2618":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#a-first-example","content":"`db` 提供 `database`，于是 `greeter` 启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2619":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#a-first-example","content":"更新 `db` 的配置会让它重启。`greeter` 依赖它，所以 `greeter` 先停止，再用新的数据库重新启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2620":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#a-first-example","content":"释放（dispose）`db` 会撤回 `database`：`greeter` 停止，它的 interval 被撤销，`closing` 日志作为拆除过程的一部分输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2621":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#a-first-example","content":"一个更长、可运行的版本，还演示了热替换数据库的实现：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2622":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#a-first-example","content":"使用门面 crate `kardia` 时，两个宏都要写 `crate = ::kardia`。生成的代码默认引用 `::kardia_core`，只有直接依赖 `kardia-core` 时才能用默认值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2623":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#services","content":"服务是绑定到一个**键**（key）上的任意 `Send + Sync + 'static` 类型，键是字符串。之所以用字符串而不是类型 id，是因为配置文件要通过名字引用服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2624":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#services","content":"`#[derive(Service)]` 默认把类型名转成连字符形式作为键，除非给出 `name`。`Service` trait 还有一个成员 `merge_intercept`，用于合并拦截（interception）元数据；它的默认实现（对 JSON 对象做右偏的浅合并）适用于大多数服务。见服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2625":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"插件在 `apply` 中提供服务：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2626":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2627":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"提供","locale":"zh-CN"},"2628":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"`ctx.provide(value)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2629":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"一个 `Service` 值，使用它自己的键","locale":"zh-CN"},"2630":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"`ctx.provide_arc(arc)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2631":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"同上，来自已有的 `Arc`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2632":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"`ctx.provide_as(key, value)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2633":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"任意值，使用显式给出的键","locale":"zh-CN"},"2634":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"`ctx.provide_serialized_as(key, value)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2635":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"一个 `serde::Serialize` 值，同时带有 JSON 视图","locale":"zh-CN"},"2636":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"提供服务是提供者插件的一个效应（effect）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2637":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"插件停止时，绑定被撤回；它的消费者（consumer）先停止。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2638":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"一个领域（realm，服务的作用域，见隔离）中每个键最多只有一个绑定。提供一个已被绑定的键会以 `KardiaError::AlreadyProvided` 失败，并指出提供者（provider）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2639":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"提供者插件处于活动状态后，消费者才能看到这个绑定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2640":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#services-for-expressions","content":"配置文件中的表达式以及工具以 JSON 形式读取服务。只有具备 JSON 视图的服务才能这样读取：用 `provide_serialized_as` 提供的服务，或直接提供的 `serde_json::Value`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2641":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#services-for-expressions","content":"这样，一个在 `inject` 中声明了 `settings` 的条目（entry）就可以写 `disabled: !!js \"!settings.enabled\"`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2642":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"访问方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2643":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"检查依据","locale":"zh-CN"},"2644":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"失败时","locale":"zh-CN"},"2645":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"`ctx.get::<S>()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2646":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"插件声明的依赖，在运行时检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"2647":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"`S` 未声明时为 `AccessError::Undeclared`；已声明但没有绑定时为 `AccessError::Inactive`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2648":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"`Injected<D>::get::<S, _>()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2649":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"`D`，在编译时检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"2650":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"`S` 不在 `D` 中时编译错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"2651":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"`Injected<D>::deps()`、`ctx.deps::<D>()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2652":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"一次检查 `D` 的全部成员","locale":"zh-CN"},"2653":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"同 `get`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2654":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"`ctx.get_as::<T>(key)`、`ctx.view(key)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2655":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"运行时给出的键（`view` 读取 JSON 视图）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2656":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"同 `get`，或 `AccessError::TypeMismatch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2657":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"`ctx.live::<S>()`、`ctx.live_as::<T>(key)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2658":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"不检查：读取当前绑定（若其提供者处于活动状态）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2659":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"从不失败；返回 `Option`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2660":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"受检访问读取的是插件的**已提交视图**（committed view）：插件启动时解析到的那些绑定。访问从插件自身提供的服务开始，沿祖先向上查找，在隔离边界处停止，返回插件所提交的第一个绑定。由于消费者读取的是已提交视图而不是实时存储，消费者自身被拆除期间，它的依赖仍然可读（元理论中的定理 70）。根上下文（context）可以不受检查地访问实时存储。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2661":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"带类型的访问返回 `Svc<S>`，它解引用为 `S`，并记住发起访问的上下文（调用者）。`timer` 之类的服务利用调用者，把它们代你完成的工作记为*你的*插件的效应；调用者归属、拦截和事件见服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2662":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugins","content":"插件就是论文中的组件（component）`(d, p, e)`：它依赖的服务（`d`）、它提供的服务（`p`），以及它运行时执行的效应（`e`）。编写插件有四种方式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2663":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-macro","content":"函数必须是 `async`，并返回 `Result<()>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2664":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-macro","content":"第一个参数是 `Context`（不声明依赖）或 `Injected<(A, B, …)>`（声明 `A`、`B`……，最多八个）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2665":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-macro","content":"可选的第二个参数是配置，类型为 `Arc<Config>`。没有它时，插件不接受配置（`()`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2666":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-macro","content":"宏会生成一个以函数名的驼峰形式命名的插件类型（`hello_world` → `HelloWorld`，`user` → `User`），并保留原函数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2667":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-macro","content":"参数：`name` 设置插件名（默认是连字符形式的函数名，即 `hello-world`），`provide` 列出它提供的键，`crate` 是 kardia crate 的路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2668":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/do