e-services-99","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`cannot get property \"key\" without inject`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2894":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-100","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`Inactive { key }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2895":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-101","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`cannot get required service \"key\" in inactive context`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2896":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-102","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`TypeMismatch { key, expected }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2897":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-103","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`service \"key\" is not of type …`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2898":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-104","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#injected","content":"`Injected<D>` 包装一个插件上下文，其类型化访问在编译期按声明的依赖 `D` 检查。`#[plugin]` 宏从函数签名读出 `D`，同时生成依赖声明和包装：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2899":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-105","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#injected","content":"`Injected::get::<S, _>()`：`_` 是 `S` 在 `D` 中被推断出的位置（`kardia_core::index::I0` … `I7`），无需手写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2900":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-106","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#injected","content":"`Injected::deps()` 以 `Svc` 元组形式返回 `D` 中的全部服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2901":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-107","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#injected","content":"`Injected::context()` 返回底层不受检的 `Context`；`Injected<D>` 也解引用为它，因此 `Context` 的其他方法都可直接使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2902":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-108","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#injected","content":"`#[plugin(name = \"…\", provide = [\"key\"], crate = path)]` 作用于一个 `async fn`，其第一个参数为 `Context` 或 `Injected<(..)>`，可选的第二个参数为 `Arc<Config>`。它生成一个以函数名的驼峰形式命名的插件类型（`greeter` → `Greeter`），插件名默认为连字符化的函数名，可用 `name` 指定。编写插件的内容见插件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2903":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-109","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"每次访问都返回一个 `Svc<T>`：服务值加上**调用者**（caller），即发起访问的上下文。Cordis 用 JavaScript `Proxy` 归属调用；kardia 把调用者显式地放进句柄。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2904":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-110","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2905":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-111","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"返回","locale":"zh-CN"},"2906":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-112","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"`*svc`（`Deref`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2907":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-113","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"服务值","locale":"zh-CN"},"2908":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-114","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"`svc.caller()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2909":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-115","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"发起访问的 `Context`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2910":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-116","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"`svc.key()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2911":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-117","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"访问时使用的键","locale":"zh-CN"},"2912":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-118","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"`svc.impl_id()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2913":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-119","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"绑定的标识（永不复用，因此\"被相等的值替换\"也可观察到）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2914":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-120","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"`svc.arc()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2915":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-121","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"`Arc<T>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2916":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-122","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"`svc.provider()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2917":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-123","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"提供它的纤程（服务的定义点）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2918":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-124","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"`svc.logger()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2919":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-125","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"代表调用者工作时用的日志器：名称取调用者 `logger` 拦截元数据中的 `name`，否则取提供它的插件名","locale":"zh-CN"},"2920":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-126","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"`svc.intercepts()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2921":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-127","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"本次访问适用的拦截元数据，由外到内","locale":"zh-CN"},"2922":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-128","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"`svc.meta()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2923":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-129","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"用 `S::merge_intercept` 合并后的元数据","locale":"zh-CN"},"2924":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-130","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"**代表调用者创建效应。** 为调用者创建效应的服务方法把效应登记在 `svc.caller()` 上。这样效应属于调用者的纤程，在*调用者*卸载时撤销，这正是 Cordis 的追踪器借助 `this.ctx` 达到的效果。服务 crate 把这类方法实现为 **`Svc<S>` 上的扩展 trait**；由于 trait 是本地定义的，一致性规则允许这样做。计时器服务就是这样做的（已简化：实际的 `timeout` 在触发后还会撤销自己的效应）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2925":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-131","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"因此上面 `greeter` 中的 `timer.interval(..)` 在 `greeter` 卸载时停止，而不是在计时器插件卸载时停止。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2926":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-132","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"**服务自身的依赖。** 服务通过构造时保存的 `Context`（它的定义点）解析自己的依赖，因此不需要影子上下文。由此产生两点与 Cordis 不同的行为（在 Cordis 中两者都跟随使用点）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2927":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-133","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"外层调用者的拦截元数据不会传到该服务继而调用的其他服务；它留在 `Svc::caller()` 上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2928":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-134","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"服务通过其保存的上下文创建的效应属于服务自己的纤程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2929":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-135","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#interception","content":"拦截沿上下文链为某个键附加元数据，使服务可以针对不同调用者表现不同（论文定义 26–27）。典型例子是日志器：`logger: { name: db, level: 3 }` 会为其下的一切重命名日志器并调整级别。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2930":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-136","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#interception","content":"元数据的来源，由外到内：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2931":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-137","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#interception","content":"准许本次访问的 `inject` 所声明的元数据（`Inject::with_meta`，或条目的 `inject: { key: meta }`）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2932":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-138","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#interception","content":"调用者派生链上的每个 `ctx.intercept(key, meta)`，由外到内（加载器条目的 `intercept` 字段会加上一层）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2933":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-139","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#interception","content":"`Svc::intercepts()` 返回这个列表，`Svc::meta()` 用 `S::merge_intercept` 合并它；默认是 `merge_shallow`：逐键合并对象，后者覆盖前者，类似 `Object.assign`。在你的 `Service` 实现中覆盖 `merge_intercept` 即可换用其他合并方式。在上下文上，`ctx.intercepts(key)` 返回链上的元数据，`ctx.intercept_meta::<T>(key)` 合并并反序列化它（元数据格式错误时得到 `T::default()`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2934":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-140","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#interception","content":"元数据也会传给可用性谓词：`provide_checked` 把消费者的元数据交给谓词。加载器借此实现 `inject: { loader: { await: true } }`：只有当所有条目都已稳定，`loader` 才对该条目可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2935":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-141","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#isolation","content":"每个键都位于某个**领域**（realm）中。默认情况下所有上下文共享该键的根领域；隔离一个键会给某个上下文及其派生的一切一个自己的领域：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2936":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-142","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#isolation","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2937":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-143","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#isolation","content":"派生出的上下文中","locale":"zh-CN"},"2938":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-144","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#isolation","content":"`ctx.isolate(key)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2939":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-145","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#isolati