ript-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-typescript#bridge","content":"桥","locale":"zh-CN"},"3061":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-typescript#host","content":"宿主：`kardia-bridge`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3062":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-typescript#client","content":"客户端：`@kardiajs/bridge` 与 `@kardiajs/tauri`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3063":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-typescript#client-services","content":"来自客户端的服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"3064":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-typescript#vue","content":"Vue 界面","locale":"zh-CN"},"3065":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"职责归属","locale":"zh-CN"},"3066":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-typescript#protocol","content":"协议","locale":"zh-CN"},"3067":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"kardia 组合的是 Rust 应用。当应用的一部分是 TypeScript 时（例如界面运行在 webview 中的 Tauri 应用），`@kardiajs` 系列包为这一侧提供同样的模型：插件、服务、可撤销效应与生命周期。两个运行时之间由**桥**（bridge）连接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3068":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"包","locale":"zh-CN"},"3069":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"3070":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"`@kardiajs/core`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3071":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"上下文、纤程、可撤销效应、响应式服务、事件与日志。无依赖，可在浏览器和 Node 中运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3072":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"`@kardiajs/timer`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3073":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"`timeout`、`interval`、`sleep`、`throttle` 与 `debounce`，在所属插件停止时取消","locale":"zh-CN"},"3074":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"`@kardiajs/bridge`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3075":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"桥的客户端","locale":"zh-CN"},"3076":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"`@kardiajs/tauri`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3077":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"桥在 Tauri 上的传输：一个命令加一个 `Channel`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3078":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"`@kardiajs/vue`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3079":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"Vue 集成：贡献点、`<ExtensionSlot>`、组合式函数、路由","locale":"zh-CN"},"3080":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"`kardia-bridge`（crate）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3081":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"桥的宿主端，位于 Rust 应用中","locale":"zh-CN"},"3082":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#model","content":"每个运行时组合自己的插件。Rust 插件不能是 TypeScript 插件的子插件，反之亦然：效应的逆操作是某个运行时内存中的闭包，服务也是那里的值。因此桥并不共享一棵插件树，而是让每一侧对另一侧的视图保持同步：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3083":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#model","content":"**效应从不跨越边界。** 每一侧各自撤销自己的效应。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3084":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#model","content":"**服务的可用性会跨越边界。** 宿主暴露的服务恰在暴露期间出现在客户端，所以注入它的客户端插件恰在此时运行，并在它被重新暴露时重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3085":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#model","content":"**调用是异步的**，两个方向都是。另一侧已不在时调用以 `unavailable` 失败，未按时应答时以 `timeout` 失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3086":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#model","content":"**事件**从宿主发往每个客户端，以名称区分。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3087":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#model","content":"这正是论文为跨越进程边界所描述的安排（每个进程承载自己的上下文，进程之间的调用遵循异步约定，见相关工作）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3088":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#core","content":"它移植的是 Kardia 的核心，而不是对 TypeScript Cordis 的封装：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3089":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#core","content":"**插件**是函数、类或带 `apply` 的对象，各自可带 `name`、`inject`、`provide` 和 `Config`（任意 Standard Schema 校验器）。`apply` 可以返回 promise，或返回一个在插件停止时运行的函数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3090":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#core","content":"**服务**以字符串为键。`ctx.get(key)` 是带检查的访问：插件未声明的服务会失败。`ctx.live(key)` 不经检查读取实时存储。`Service` 返回的是一个视图，其 `caller` 是发起访问的上下文，对应 Kardia 的 `Svc::caller`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3091":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#core","content":"**效应：** `ctx.effect(scope => ...)` 用 `scope.defer` 收集逆操作，或直接返回一个。异步的效应体不会被取消：效应被处置后，`scope.checkpoint()` 会结束它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3092":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#core","content":"**生命周期：** 纤程依次经历 `pending`、`loading`、`active`、`unloading`、`failed` 和 `disposed`，与 Rust 一致。依赖被替换时插件重启，依赖离开时插件等待，提供者会一直运行到它的消费者完成清理。`fiber.update(config)`、`restart()`、`ctx.onUpdate(...)` 和 `ctx.registry.replace(old, new)`（热替换，用于 Vite HMR）的行为都与 Rust 相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3093":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#core","content":"**事件**以名称区分：`ctx.on`、`emit`、`bail`、`serial`、`parallel`。运行时会报告 `internal/plugin-inserted`、`internal/plugin-removed`、`internal/status`、`internal/service`、`internal/commit` 和 `internal/replace`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3094":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#core","content":"**隔离与拦截：** `ctx.isolate(key, realm?)`、`ctx.intercept(key, meta)`、`ctx.interceptMeta(key)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3095":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#core","content":"它与 Kardia 和 Cordis 的不同之处列在实现状态中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3096":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#recovery","content":"本节新增 API 包含在 npm 0.2.0 中。Rust 与 JS 的插件实例分别由各自运行时监督；配置 Rust 恢复策略不会自动修改 JS 插件策略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3097":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#recovery","content":"`fiber.setRecovery(policy)` 为一个插件句柄选择恢复策略，跨越该插件实例的卸载与重新加载。默认是 `{ type: \"manual\" }`，不强制重启。故障只影响失败实例及依赖其服务的消费者，无关插件必须继续工作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3098":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#recovery","content":"策略","locale":"zh-CN"},"3099":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#recovery","content":"行为","locale":"zh-CN"},"3100":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#recovery","content":"`{ type: \"manual\" }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3101":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#recovery","content":"保持 failed，等待宿主调用 `fiber.update(fiber.config, true)`，或修改配置/替换实现","locale":"zh-CN"},"3102":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#recovery","content":"`{ type: \"retry\", delay: 1000 }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3103":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#recovery","content":"清理完成后等待指定毫秒，再用当前配置恢复；失败后按同样间隔重试","locale":"zh-CN"},"3104":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#recovery","content":"`{ type: \"host\", handler }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3105":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#recovery","content":"清理完成后调用宿主，返回 `{ type: \"keep-failed\" }` 或 `{ type: \"retry\", delay: 1000 }`；可以返回 Promise","locale":"zh-CN"},"3106":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#recovery","content":"`fail()` 同步发起失效处理，清理异步完成；`settled()` 在失败结算后拒绝。普通 `restart()` 不清除失败，手动恢复使用 `update`。自动恢复不触发配置写回事件。retry 延时必须为有限正数且不大于 2,147,483,647 毫秒，避免 JS 定时器溢出导致高频重试。`ValidationError` 不会在配置未变时被自动重试，host 返回 retry 也一样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3107":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#recovery","content":"host 收到 `{ fiber, error, signal }`。切换策略、手动更新、替换实现或移除插件会使过期决定失效；取消时 `signal` 被中止。宿主应将它传给支持取消的异步操作。框架不能强制终止任意 Promise，但不会执行已取消决定所返回的重试。宿主处理函数抛错或拒绝时记录错误，插件保持失败，无关插件继续运行。根上下文不能调用 `setRecovery` 或 `fail`，不能用重启根上下文恢复单个插件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3108":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#timer-failures","content":"`@kardiajs/timer` 的 timeout、interval、throttle、debounce 捕获回调同步异常和异步拒绝，日志归属于安排回调的插件。它们按**操作错误**处理，不自动将整个插件置为 failed；interval 后续仍可执行。若插件已无法继续工作，应显式调用 `ctx.fiber.fail(error)`，再由选定策略处理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3109":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#timer-failures","content":"卸载先取消后续触发，再等待已经开始的异步回调结束；timeout 的 effect 保留到回调结束。这保证受管理回调不会跨越旧实例清理边界。回调必须返回其异步工作的 Promise；脱离返回链的后台任务、原生定时器不受此机制管理。不要在回调内部等待自身 effect 或所属 fiber 的 dispose 完成，这会形成自等待；报告实例故障时使用非等待的 `fail()`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3110":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#timer-failures","content":"同一 JS 线程无法隔离无限循环、运行时崩溃或进程退出，也不能强制取消不配合的 Promise。这里保证的是框架管理的异常处理与生命周期；需要强隔离的执行应使用应用提供的独立执行边界。Vue 贡献的错误边界仍只隔离该贡献，不默认停止所属插件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3111":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#host","content":"应用创建一个 `Bridge`，挂载它的插件，并把客户端请求交给 `Bridge::handle`。插件注入 `bridge` 并暴露服务；暴露是暴露它的插件的效应，因此该插件停止时会被撤回：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3112":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#host","content":"`Bridge::handle` 在桥插件所在的运行时上执行工作，因此 Tauri 命令可以从 Tauri 的运行时调用它。Tauri 一侧的胶水代码只有一个命令（`kardia-bridge` 的 crate 文档给出了完整写法）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3113":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#host","content":"窗口销毁时调用 `bridge.close_client(label)`。页面重新加载无需处理：新会话会替换同一标签的旧会话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3114":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#client","content":"宿主服务显示为 `host.<name>`，宿主事件显示为 `host/<name>`（`prefix` 选项可以修改 `host`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3115":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#client","content":"客户端在后台连接，并在宿主的桥重启后重新连接。断开期间它的插件仍处于活跃状态，只是宿主服务不存在。`bridge.status` 和 `bridge/status` 事件报告 `connecting`、`connected`、`disconnected` 或 `replaced`（同一标签的另一个 webview 接管了会话；此时不会重连）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3116":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#client","content":"失败的调用以 `BridgeError` 拒绝，其 `type` 为 `unavailable`、`timeout`、`invalid` 或 `failed`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3117":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#client-services","content":"客户端可以向宿主提供服务，作为调用它的插件的效应：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3118":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#client-services","content":"宿主把它看作 `RemoteService`，由客户端的会话纤程提供，会话结束时撤回：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3119":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#client-services","content":"客户端随时可能关闭，而 Rust 应用通常在没有任何窗口时也在运行。所以宿主插件应在需要时查找客户端服务（`live_as`），而不是在 `inject` 中声明它，否则窗口一关闭该插件就会停止。每次重连后，客户端都会重新提供它的服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3120":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#vue","content":"`@kardiajs/vue` 让扩展向 Vue 界面贡献内容：组件、视图、设置分区、命令、路由。贡献是做出它的插件的效应，因此该插件停止时贡献随之移除，界面也随之更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3121":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#vue","content":"**贡献点**是 `Contributions<T>` 服务（`defineContributions(key)` 提供一个）。`register(item)` 是调用它的插件的效应；条目按 `order` 排序，`id` 唯一，`items` / `entries` 是 Vue 响应式的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3122":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#vue","content":"**`<ExtensionSlot name>`** 按顺序渲染一个贡献点的组件。每个组件都获得贡献它的插件的上下文，因此在组件内部 `useContext()`、`usePlugin()` 和 `useService()` 都以该插件的身份工作，其效应也随该插件停止。`props` 传给每个组件，位于各贡献自身的 `props` 之下；没有内容时显示默认插槽；`item` 插槽（`{ item, owner }`）可自行渲染每个贡献。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3123":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#vue","content":"**出错的贡献**会被隔离：抛出异常的贡献（在 setup、渲染、钩子、侦听器或事件处理函数中）会被 `error` 插槽（`{ error, item, owner, retry }`）取代，没有该插槽时不渲染任何内容；其他贡献照常渲染，错误也不会传到应用。`retry()` 重新挂载它。`@error`（`{ error, item, owner }`）报告这次失败，例如用于显示是哪个插件出错；没有它时，失败由所属插件的日志器记录。所属插件继续运行：出错的视图只是该插件的一个贡献，停止插件还会移除它的服务和其他贡献。要停止它，可在 `@error` 中调用 `owner.fiber.dispose()`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3124":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#vue","content":"**组合式函数：** `useContext()`；`usePlugin(plugin, config)` 在组件存续期间运行一个插件；`useService(key)` 是跟随某个服务的 ref（未被提供时为 `undefined`）；`useContributions(key)` 是用于自定义渲染（如导航菜单）的计算列表；`useFiberState(fiber)` 跟随一个纤程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3125":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#vue","content":"**路由：** `addRoute(ctx, router, route)` 以效应的形式添加 vue-router 路由：插件停止时路由被移除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3126":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#vue","content":"**只有 Rust 部分的扩展**无法携带 Vue 代码，但 Rust 插件可以暴露一个描述其界面的值（例如设置 schema），再由 TypeScript 插件为它注册一个通用组件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3127":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#vue","content":"第三方界面代码在 webview 中拥有对 Tauri 的全部访问权限：只把可信代码加载到主 webview，对不可信的扩展使用声明式贡献或沙箱化的 webview。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3128":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"归属","locale":"zh-CN"},"3129":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"后端能力、状态、设置、持久化","locale":"zh-CN"},"3130":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"kardia 上的 Rust 插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"3131":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"界面组合：设置分区、命令、渲染器、面板","locale":"zh-CN"},"3132":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"`@kardiajs/core` 上的 TypeScript 插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"3133":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"客户端能看到哪些宿主服务，以及对它们的调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3134":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"宿主的 `expose`，经由桥","locale":"zh-CN"},"3135":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"传输、窗口身份、权限","locale":"zh-CN"},"3136":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"Tauri（一个命令，每个会话一个 `Channel`，capabilities）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3137":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"一个扩展可以只有 Rust 部分（大多数后端能力；界面渲染它暴露的内容），只有 TypeScript 部分（使用已有宿主服务的面板或命令），或者两者兼有：一个暴露服务的 Rust 插件，加上一个注入 `host.<name>` 的 TypeScript 插件，使界面部分恰在后端部分运行时运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3138":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#protocol","content":"协议（版本 1）是以 `type` 标记、字段为 camelCase 的 JSON；未知字段会被忽略。`kardia-bridge` 的 crate 文档列出了每种请求和消息。任何传输都可以使用：桥的端到端测试通过 stdin 和 stdout 驱动 Rust 宿主（`crates/kardia-bridge/examples/stdio_host.rs`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3139":{"id":"/docs/guide","page_id":"/docs/guide","type":"page","content":"使用指南","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","使用指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide","locale":"zh-CN"},"3140":{"id":"/docs/guide-0","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide","content":"如何使用 kardia：配置文件、插件、服务、效应、加载器、热重载与访客插件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3141":{"id":"/docs/guide-1","page_id":"/docs/guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide#which-page-do-i-need","content":"我需要哪一页？","locale":"zh-CN"},"3142":{"id":"/docs/guide-2","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide","content":"本指南讲解如何用 kardia 构建应用：从 `kardia` 可执行文件的配置文件，到用 Rust 编写的插件（plugin），再到可以原地重新加载的访客插件（guest plugin）。阅读前请先安装 kardia；快速开始先展示了一个运行中的应用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3143":{"id":"/docs/guide-3","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide","content":"<Card title=\"配置文件\" href=\"/docs/guide-configuration\" d