","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#which-page-do-i-need","content":"**用配置文件运行应用**：配置文件，然后是热重载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3153":{"id":"/docs/guide-13","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#which-page-do-i-need","content":"**编写编译进应用的插件**：编写插件、服务和效应。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3154":{"id":"/docs/guide-14","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#which-page-do-i-need","content":"**围绕加载器构建自己的宿主（host）**：加载器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3155":{"id":"/docs/guide-15","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#which-page-do-i-need","content":"**编写无需重启应用即可重新加载的插件**：访客插件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3156":{"id":"/docs/guide-16","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#which-page-do-i-need","content":"**加入 TypeScript 一侧，例如 Tauri webview**：TypeScript 与 Tauri。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3157":{"id":"/docs/guide-17","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#which-page-do-i-need","content":"本指南描述如何使用 kardia。为什么这样设计见开发，背后的理论见概念。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3158":{"id":"/docs","page_id":"/docs","type":"page","content":"kardia","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","开始"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs","locale":"zh-CN"},"3159":{"id":"/docs-0","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"Cordis 的 Rust 实现：一个建立在时空可组合性之上的插件框架。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3160":{"id":"/docs-1","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#kardia-cordis-and-the-paper","content":"kardia、Cordis 与论文","locale":"zh-CN"},"3161":{"id":"/docs-2","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#how-this-documentation-is-organised","content":"文档的组织方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"3162":{"id":"/docs-3","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#concepts-the-paper","content":"概念：论文","locale":"zh-CN"},"3163":{"id":"/docs-4","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#cordis-reference-the-typescript-code","content":"Cordis 参考：TypeScript 代码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3164":{"id":"/docs-5","page_id":"/