e":"text","url":"/docs/reference-events#internal-events","content":"`internal/config` 校验器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3607":{"id":"/docs/reference-events-70","page_id":"/docs/reference-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-events#logger","content":"`logger.ts`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3608":{"id":"/docs/reference-events-71","page_id":"/docs/reference-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-events#logger","content":"`LoggerService` 是一个可调用的 `noShadow` 服务：`ctx.logger(name?)` 返回一个 `Logger`；`ctx.logger.info(...)` 是 `ctx.logger().info(...)` 的简写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3609":{"id":"/docs/reference-events-72","page_id":"/docs/reference-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-events#logger","content":"**名称解析：** 显式参数 → 拦截元数据 `{ name }` → *调用方*纤程的连字符化名称（`fiber.name` 向上找到第一个有名称的 runtime，否则为 `root`）。在服务方法内部，调用方是该服务的定义点，因此日志行归属于该服务（`logger.spec.ts` 回归测试）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3610":{"id":"/docs/reference-events-73","page_id":"/docs/reference-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-events#logger","content":"**级别：** `exporter.levels[name] ?? exporter.levels.default ?? logger.level ?? INFO`；级别为 `ERROR=0, WARN=1, INFO=2, DEBUG=3`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3611":{"id":"/docs/reference-events-74","page_id":"/docs/reference-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-events#logger","content":"**消息：** `{ sn, ts, name, type, level, args, fiber?: WeakRef<Fiber> }`。带 `cause` 的错误会记录其 cause；非空的 `AggregateError` 会被展平。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3612":{"id":"/docs/reference-events-75","page_id":"/docs/reference-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-events#logger","content":"**导出器**通过 `logger.exporter(exp)` 以被追踪的效应注册，因此控制台导出器插件在卸载时会自行注销。一个内置导出器维护最近 1000 条消息的环形缓冲区（供后接入的控制台使用）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3613":{"id":"/docs/reference-events-76","page_id":"/docs/reference-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-events#logger","content":"`Logger.format` 实现 printf 风格的 `%s %d %i %f %o %O %c %C`，格式化器可由导出器覆盖，支持颜色代码（由日志器名称哈希得到的 16/256 色调色板）与逐行截断（`maxLength`，默认 10240）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3614":{"id":"/docs/reference-events-77","page_id":"/docs/reference-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-events#port","content":"事件只是一个建立在 `ctx.effect` 之上的服务。生命周期中除内部钩子（status、service、commit、update、config）之外，没有任何东西依赖它们。移植可以实现类型化的事件通道，并保留一小组内部钩子点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3615":{"id":"/docs/reference-events-78","page_id":"/docs/reference-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-events#port","content":"`waterfall` 兼作核心行为的扩展机制（`internal/get`、`internal/config`、`internal/update`）。在 Rust 中，这些更适合表达为显式的钩子 trait 或注册表，而不是以字符串标识的事件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3616":{"id":"/docs/reference-events-79","page_id":"/docs/reference-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-events#port","content":"日志器可以自然地映射到 `tracing`（每个纤程一个 span，日志器名称作为 target），但如果控制台会在运行时接入，就必须保留*导出器即效应*与缓冲区的语义。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3617":{"id":"/docs/reference-events-80","page_id":"/docs/reference-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-events#port","content":"kardia 的做法见 API 设计。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3618":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","type":"page","content":"纤程生命周期与注册表","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","Cordis 参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-fibers","locale":"zh-CN"},"3619":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-0","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers","content":"Cordis 核心如何把插件实例化为纤程、计算其目标，并借助惯性与守卫驱动它们经历加载/卸载状态机。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3620":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-1","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-fibers#plugins","content":"插件（组件）与 runtime","locale":"zh-CN"},"3621":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-2","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-fibers#ctx-plugin","content":"`ctx.plugin(plugin, config)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3622":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-3","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-