-14","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#group","content":"`packages/group/src/index.ts` 只是从加载器（loader）重新导出 `Group`（见 `EntryTree` 与 `EntryGroup`）。它的配置就是子条目（entry）列表；配置更新以按键差异的方式被原地吸收。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3874":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-15","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#include","content":"`class Include extends EntryTree`，`inject = ['loader']`，用法：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3875":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-16","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#include","content":"它是一个类插件，其异步生成器 `[Service.init]` 读取文件、产出 `() => this.stop()`，然后应用这棵树。其条目的复合 id 为 `<includeEntryId>:<localId>`；include（配置文件引入）可以嵌套。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3876":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-17","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#include","content":"`path` 相对于父树的 `baseUrl` 解析；include 自己的 `ctx.baseUrl` 变为该文件所在目录（嵌套的名称与 include 相对于该文件解析）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3877":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-18","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#include","content":"文件不存在时（仅 ENOENT）写入 `initial`；已存在但无法解析的文件**永远不会被覆盖**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3878":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-19","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#include","content":"`watch: true` → `ctx.inject(['fs'], ctx => ctx.fs.watch(filename).on('change', () => this.refresh()))`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3879":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-20","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#include","content":"一个 `internal/update` 监听器原地重新配置（新的 `patches`），除非 `path`/`watch` 发生变化（此时完全重启）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3880":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-21","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#state","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"3881":{"id":"/docs/refe