01":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-42","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#read","content":"读取；内容相同 ⇒ 什么也不做（这也抑制了自身写入引起的监听器回馈）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3902":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-43","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#read","content":"解析 YAML（无论 `%YAML` 如何都使用 core schema，自定义标签 `!!js`，**错误与警告都是致命的**）或 JSON；把问题映射到 `file:line:col`（从 1 开始，**UTF-16 列**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3903":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-44","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#read","content":"校验顶层数组与各对象条目；失败时保留之前的树。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3904":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-45","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#read","content":"为匿名条目分配 id（跨读取稳定：若父级相同且选项深度相等，则复用之前的 id）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3905":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-46","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#read","content":"若不是第一次读取：对 journal 与新旧文件状态做三方**协调**；冲突时**文件胜出**，每个冲突都会被记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3906":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-47","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#read","content":"缓存并调度一次应用；若 journal 非空，调度一次写入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3907":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-48","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#write","content":"重新读取；若文件被外部修改，先合并。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3908":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-49","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#write","content":"对 journal 做快照并交换；`routeJournal` 把每个变更发送给其**所有者**：文件数据、include 自身配置中的某个补丁，或嵌入在补丁中的某个条目。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3909":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-50","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#write","content":"补丁变更通过 `this.ctx.fiber.update(newConfig)`（不 await）持久化，它经 `internal/commit` 流入**父**树的文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3910":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-51","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#write","content":"文件变更被整体导出（**整文件重新生成：注释与格式会丢失**）并原子写入：在同一目录下的临时文件 `.<base>.<pid>.<seq>.tmp`，在**每次**重命名尝试前检查内容是否过时，遇到 EACCES/EPERM/EBUSY 时重试重命名（11 次尝试，线性退避）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3911":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-52","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#write","content":"只读文件把变更保留在内存中，并给出警告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3912":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-53","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#apply","content":"`applyPatches(cache.data, patches)`（每次都是新克隆，因此移除补丁即可还原）→ `applyJournal(data, journal)`（叠加尚未写入的运行时变更）→ 最新者胜出的 `root.update(tree)` → `EntryGroup` 按键协调。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3913":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-54","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"`journal.ts` 由纯函数组成：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3914":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-55","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"函数","locale":"zh-CN"},"3915":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-56","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"3916":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-57","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"`record`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3917":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-58","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"在报告时捕获的增量","locale":"zh-CN"},"3918":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-59","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"`mergeRecords`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3919":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-60","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"remove∘created-upsert = 无；remove 之后的 upsert ⇒ `created:false`；changes 按较新者胜出合并","locale":"zh-CN"},"3920":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-61","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"`flatten`、`applyChanges`、`detach`、`place`、`applyJournal`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3921":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-62","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"把记录应用到条目列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"3922":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-63","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"`reconcile(journal, base, theirs, fileOwned)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3923":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-64","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"三方合并，冲突的键/移动/移除会从 journal 中丢弃（“文件胜出”）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3924":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-65","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#patches","content":"`patch.ts`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3925":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-66","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#patches","content":"**插入补丁** `{ id?, insert: [...] }` 把条目追加到某个分组（或根）中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3926":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-67","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#patches","content":"**覆盖补丁** `{ id, name?, ...keys }` 覆盖现有条目的键。若给出 `name`，它必须匹配（防止误给另一个插件打补丁）；覆盖分组的 `config` 会替换其子级列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3927":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-68","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#patches","content":"`applyPatches` 构建一个 `PatchIndex`，记录每个条目与键的**所有者**：`file`、`patch{index}` 或 `embedded{index, key}`。后面的补丁可以引用前面补丁插入的条目。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3928":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-69","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#patches","content":"`routeJournal` 把每次运行时编辑写回其所有者：补丁拥有的键 → 该补丁；由补丁插入的条目 → 补丁内部；其余 → 文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3929":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-70","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#source-locations","content":"`_route(id, path)` 找到某个值被写在哪里（文件、补丁、嵌入），并沿嵌套的 include 向上委托，生成形如 `at a (inner.yml:1:3)` / `at inc (middle.yml:1:3)` 的虚拟栈帧。`walk` 下降遍历 YAML AST（把别名解析到锚点）；`seekExpr`/`scanScalar` 把表达式内部的偏移映射为文件偏移（解码带引号标量中的转义）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3930":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-71","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"3931":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-72","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"所在","locale":"zh-CN"},"3932":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-73","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"`ConfigFileError(stage: 'read'\\|'parse'\\|'validate', path, cause, issues[])`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3933":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-74","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"include","locale":"zh-CN"},"3934":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-75","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"`StaleWriteError`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3935":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-76","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"include（内部）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3936":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-77","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"`EntryValidationError`、`ModuleNotFoundError`、重定位后的 `ValidationError`","loca