reference-paper-vs-code-83","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#correspondences","content":"另加自有提供与隔离边界","locale":"zh-CN"},"4179":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-84","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#correspondences","content":"条目字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"4180":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-85","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#correspondences","content":"定义 81","locale":"zh-CN"},"4181":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-86","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#correspondences","content":"`EntryOptions`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4182":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-87","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#correspondences","content":"增加了 `inject`、`group`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4183":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-88","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#correspondences","content":"托管领域 + 分隔符","locale":"zh-CN"},"4184":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-89","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#correspondences","content":"算法 7","locale":"zh-CN"},"4185":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-90","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#correspondences","content":"`loader/src/config/isolate.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4186":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-91","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#correspondences","content":"另加提供者自身 impl 的免重启迁移","locale":"zh-CN"},"4187":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-92","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#target","content":"**论文：** `fiber.target` 是 `target(γ, n)`（键 → 提供者 uid 元组）的哈希，未满足时为 ⊥。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4188":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-93","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#target","content":"**代码：** `_runner.epoch` = `\"<revision>:<uid>:<uid>…\"` 或 `'__INACTIVE__'`。**修订**计数器把配置修订折叠进目标：`restart()`、`update()` 与 `registry.replace()` 会递增它，从而在不使纤程（fiber）退役的情况下强制一条卸载→重新加载链。这比“退役 → 移除 → 以同一名称重新插入”更廉价地实现了 §4.4 *Configuration* 的修订。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4189":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-94","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#target","content":"见目标计算。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4190":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-95","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#retirement","content":"**论文：** O-Retire（设置 τ）与 O-Remove（删除条目）是两条独立的规则；退役的条目可能残留（vestigial）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4191":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-96","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#retirement","content":"**代码：** 实例化效应的逆操作设置 `uid = null`（立即从 runtime 中移除），把目标强制为 ⊥，然后等待转换链；最终状态为 `DISPOSED`。不存在持久的退役条目注册表。重新启用一个条目会创建一个**全新的纤程**（如论文所规定）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4192":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-97","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#retirement","content":"见实例化。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4193":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-98","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#guard","content":"**论文（算法 5）：** `unload` 等待被 `notify(...)` 的依赖方的 `await()`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4194":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-99","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#guard","content":"**代码：** 显式的反向引用 `Impl.dependents: Set<Fiber>`，在提交时填充，在依赖方卸载结束时移除，外加唤醒用的 resolver（`impl.release`、`fiber._release`）。存在两层守卫：**纤程级**守卫（在提供者的*所有*提供项都空闲之前，它的任何撤销函数都不运行）与 `provide` 逆操作内部的**绑定级**守卫。这给出了论文按绑定的语义（`relied_n`），同时允许提供者撤回一个绑定而无需等待另一个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4195":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-100","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#guard","content":"见两层守卫。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4196":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-101","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#accumulator","content":"**论文：** 累加器是一个 LIFO 组合；算法 5 运行一次 `fiber.dispose()`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4197":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-102","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#accumulator","content":"**代码：** 纤程级撤销函数按逆序*发起*，但**并发**运行（`Promise.all`），每个都在一个微任务之后开始；错误被记录，且不会阻止其他撤销函数。顺序 LIFO 只在*单个* `ctx.effect` 内部成立。论文承认了这种并发（§5.1.3），定理 43（独立的逆操作可交换）为其提供了依据，但这意味着对顺序敏感的拆除必须组合进同一个效应。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4198":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-103","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#accumulator","content":"见纤程级累加器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4199":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-104","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#iteration-boundaries","content":"**论文：** 每次迭代之前检查守卫；L-Divert 可以中止，也可以落地。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4200":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-105","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#iteration-boundaries","content":"**代码：** 只有**异步**迭代器可中断；同步迭代器与普通函数运行至结束（在单线程宿主中它们本来也无法被中断）。异步迭代器采取*落地*分支（惯性宿主），并以 `iter.return()` 关闭，使 `finally` 块得以运行。`_reload` 在执行前还会让出一个微任务，因此被取代的加载永远不会开始。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4201":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-106","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#notification","content":"**论文：** `notify` 遍历所有纤程并调用 `refresh`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4202":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-107","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#notification","content":"**代码：** 遍历所有 runtime 的纤程，按声明的键与**领域符号**（或在领域迁移期间按自定义过滤器）筛选，只重新计算受影响的键（`_checkImpl`），然后调用 `_refresh`。它还会发出 `internal/service`。纤程提供项的通知只在进入或离开 `ACTIVE` 的转换上由 `_updateState` 发出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4203":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-108","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#notification","content":"见 `notify`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4204":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-109","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#availability","content":"代码增加了 `Impl.check`（来自 `Service[symbols.check]`）：提供者即使处于 `ACTIVE`，也可以报告自己不可用（`loader` 用它实现 `{ await: true }`）。这为满足谓词 `σ ⊧ d` 扩展了一个按提供者的条件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4205":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-110","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#access","content":"`locate` 另外 (a) 允许纤程不经声明就读取其**自有**提供项，(b) 在**隔离边界**处终止继承。根纤程（没有 runtime）获得*不加检查*的访问（`reflect.get(prop, false)`），因为根代码无法声明 `inject`。见 `locate`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4206":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-111","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#caller-attribution","content":"tracker/影子代理机制（服务与可追溯性）把服务方法内部创建的效应归属到**调用方**纤程，并从服务的**定义点**解析其自身依赖。论文的封闭性（confinement，定义 55）隐含地假设了这一点；没有它，经由服务产生的效应就会属于提供者，从而破坏消费者的时间可组合性。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4207":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-112","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#loader-specifics","content":"见加载器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4208":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-113","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#loader-specifics","content":"带 `inject` 的条目有两个纤程（外层依赖持有者 + 内层插件）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4209":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-114","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#loader-specifics","content":"表达式（`!!js`）在特定上下文中求值；`disabled` 判定被缓存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4210":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-115","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#loader-specifics","content":"自我释放检测 → 持久化 `disabled: true`；自我更新 → 持久化配置（`internal/commit`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4211":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-116","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#loader-specifics","content":"`loader { await: true }` 屏障。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4212":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-117","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#loader-specifics","content":"领域迁移无需重启提供者；被阻止的迁移通过 `Impl.isolate` 追踪。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4213":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-118","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#hmr","content":"见 HMR：论文与代码对照：注册表层面的原地替换（`registry.replace` + `_replace` + 修订号递增）取代 dispose + `ctx.use`；并查集提交单元取代全有或全无；越过不可回头点之后不再回滚。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4214":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-119","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"假设","locale":"zh-CN"},"4215":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-120","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"代码中的状况","locale":"zh-CN"},"4216":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-121","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"效应见证（逆操作确实能还原）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4217":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-122","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"不检查，是作者的义务（论文已说明）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4218":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-123","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"余效应（coeffect）的可交换性","locale":"zh-CN"},"4219":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-124","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"不检查，是提供者的义务（论文已说明）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4220":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-125","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"≺ 的无环性","locale":"zh-CN"},"4221":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-126","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"**不检测**：依赖环会让纤程静默地停留在 PENDING；论文（§6.5）说运行时*可以*在加载时报告它，但 Cordis 没有这样做","locale":"zh-CN"},"4222":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-127","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"提供的完全性（定义 76）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4223":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-128","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"不强制；插件上的 `provide` 元数据只是声明性的","locale":"zh-CN"},"4224":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-129","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"封闭性（定义 55）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4225":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-130","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"只对经由代理的余效应*访问*强制执行；任意 JS 代码仍可触及全局对象","locale":"zh-CN"},"4226":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-131","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#defects","content":"位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"4227":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-132","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#defects","content":"观察","locale":"zh-CN"},"4228":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-133","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#defects","content":"`loader/src/config/isolate.ts:150-153`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4229":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-134","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#defects","content":"领域回收扫描中的 `return` 会退出整个监听器；该条目 `legacy.isolate` 中其余名称的回收被跳过。本意可能是外层循环的 `continue`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4230":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-135","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#defects","content":"`create/src/index.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4231":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-136","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#defects","content":"`--mirror` 标志会被解析但未被使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4232":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-137","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#rust","content":"遵循**代码的**状态机（带修订号的纪元、惯性、两层守卫、`FAILED`、`DISPOSED`），因为它经过测试并能处理配置修订；文档中保留论文的名称。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4233":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-138","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#rust","content":"在代码受 JS 限制之处遵循**论文**：对所有多步效应显式设置迭代边界；在插入时检测依赖环（代价很低，因为声明是静态的）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4234":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-139","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#rust","content":"用显式的类型化句柄取代基于 Proxy 的调用方归属。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4235":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-140","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#rust","content":"在 HMR 上遵循**代码的**设计（按单元提交、原地替换），而非算法 10。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4236":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-141","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#rust","content":"在移植中修复领域回收中过早的 `return`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4237":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-142","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#rust","content":"kardia 如何落实这些，见生命周期、API 设计、加载器、include 与 HMR，以及列出全部偏离的状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4238":{"id":"/docs/reference-server","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","type":"page","content":"Server 行为参考","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","Cordis 参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-server","locale":"zh-CN"},"4239":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-0","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server","content":"固定 Cordis 基线下的 HTTP、WS、ACL、Static、Proxy 及辅助服务契约。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4240":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-1","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-server#core","content":"核心接口","locale":"zh-CN"},"4241":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-2","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-server#http","content":"请求、响应与钩子","locale":"zh-CN"},"4242":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-3","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-server#websocket","content":"WebSocket 与 Echo","locale":"zh-CN"},"4243":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-4","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-server#acl","content":"ACL","locale":"zh-CN"},"4244":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-5","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"Static","locale":"zh-CN"},"4245":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-6","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-server#proxy","content":"Proxy","locale":"zh-CN"},"4246":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-7","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-server#auxiliary","content":"辅助服务范围","locale":"zh-CN"},"4247":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-8","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server","content":"本页对应 Cordis 36dc7fb5，五个包的源码版本依次为 core 1.7.0、ACL 1.0.1、Echo 1.1.1、Static 1.2.1、Proxy 1.2.1。实现不随上游 main 或 npm 浮动版本改变预期。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4248":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-9","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#core","content":"`kardia::server` 导出 `ServerPlugin`、`ServerConfig`、`Server`、`ServerExt`、`Request`、`Response`、`Body`、`Path`、`WsExt` 等。服务键为 `server`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4249":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-10","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#core","content":"配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"4250":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-11","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#core","content":"行为","locale":"zh-CN"},"4251":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-12","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#core","content":"`host`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4252":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-13","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#core","content":"默认 `127.0.0.1`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4253":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-14","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#core","content":"`port`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4254":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-15","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#core","content":"必填，允许 `0` 由系统分配","locale":"zh-CN"},"4255":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-16","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#core","content":"`maxPort`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4256":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-17","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#core","content":"默认起始端口；仅地址占用/权限错误时逐端口尝试","locale":"zh-CN"},"4257":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-18","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#core","content":"`publicUrl`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4258":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-19","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#core","content":"显式值去尾斜杠，再附加调用者 `intercept.server.path`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4259":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-20","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#core","content":"自动 URL 使用实际端口；通配监听地址映射为 `127.0.0.1`。80/443 分别生成 http/https URL，但 URL 的 scheme **不表示监听器启用了 TLS**；服务端是 HTTP/1，TLS 可由前置宿主处理。HTTP 客户端支持 HTTPS 和 WSS。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4260":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-21","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#core","content":"`get`、`post`、`all` 注册便捷路由；`route(method, path, handler, options)` 支持 DELETE、HEAD、PUT、PATCH 等方法。顺序为注册顺序，GET 不隐式接受 HEAD。无匹配为 404，路径匹配但方法不同为 405；OPTIONS 为 204，`Allow` 使用小写方法和注册顺序，all 对应 `*`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4261":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-22","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#core","content":"字符串路径支持参数、通配符、可选组和引号参数名，遵循 path-to-regexp 8.4.2；路径捕获值解码百分号转义并保留字面量 `+`；query 保留重复键，仍将 `+` 解码为空格。`Path::regex(source, flags)` 使用 ECMAScript 正则语法，支持 g/y 状态、UTF-16 匹配和 Unicode 标志。拦截前缀按字符串匹配，不额外要求路径段边界。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4262":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-23","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#core","content":"字符串 HTTP 路由的 `intercept.server.routes[\"METHOD path\"]` 覆盖调用处 options，未覆盖字段保留；WS 和正则路由不应用这一覆盖表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4263":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-24","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#http","content":"`use_middleware`、`on_route_request` 和 `Next` 组成可短路的异步链；`on_route_check` 返回 true 表示跳过路由，HTTP/WS 共用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4264":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-25","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#http","content":"`Request` 提供 method、url、path、query、headers、params，以及 bytes/text/json/blob/form_data。请求 body 只消费一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4265":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-26","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#http","content":"`Response` 可设置状态、header、bytes/text/json/Blob/FormData/stream。显式状态或 body 标记 claimed；仅设置 header 不算完成响应。后一次 body 写入替换前一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4266":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-27","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#http","content":"普通异常或 unwind panic 在未 claimed 时返回 500；验证器的 `ValidationError` 返回 422 和 issues。已 claimed 的状态和内容保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4267":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-28","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#http","content":"返回 `Some(Response)` 时按上游采用 body、status 和 header，**不复制自定义 status text**，重复 Set-Cookie 只保留最后一个。直接对传入响应设置 status text 可以生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4268":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-29","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#http","content":"`accepts` 使用固定上游 MIME 数据和协商优先级；JSON 输出采用 JS Number 格式及整数属性排序。需要保留超过 JS Number 精度的整数时使用字符串。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4269":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-30","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#http","content":"原生 Rust API 使用 UTF-8 字符串、serde JSON 值及类型化回调，不模拟 JS 原型、可调用对象或孤立 UTF-16 surrogate。Rust 读取 JSON 的值表示不等于完整 JS Number 运行时；响应编码按对照契约处理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4270":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-31","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#websocket","content":"`ws(path, handler, options)` 注册路由。省略 handler 自动 accept；显式 handler 必须调用 `accept.accept().await`。没有 accept 则断开，accept 前异常返回 500，accept 后异常关闭连接。无匹配路由返回 404。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4271":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-32","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#websocket","content":"有效握手接受版本 13/8，选择首个请求子协议；非法 method、key、version 和 protocol 的状态、错误 body 与 header 已与上游对照。服务端最大消息为 100 MiB。`WebSocket::send/recv/close` 使用类型化 Message，保留文本/二进制及关闭原因。路由释放关闭自己的连接并回收任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4272":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-33","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#websocket","content":"Echo 只注册空路径 POST 和 WS，通过 intercept 挂载。HTTP 流式复制 body 及 content-type；WS 保留消息类型和字节。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4273":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-34","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#acl","content":"`AclPlugin` / `AclConfig` 的 `allowedHosts` 缺省或 true 表示放行；false 仅允许 loopback；数组额外允许列出的域名。忽略大小写和端口，识别方括号 IPv6；`.example.com` 同时匹配裸域与子域。单条路由 options 替换组件的 allowedHosts，不合并列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4274":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-35","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#acl","content":"拒绝表示继续查找后续路由，全部拒绝时为 404，不改成 403，也不暴露被拒路由的 Allow。此规则同时适用于 HTTP 和 WS。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4275":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-36","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"`StaticPlugin` / `StaticConfig` 依赖 `server` 与 `fs`，从 provider 读取，不绕过文件服务直接访问磁盘。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4276":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-37","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"4277":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-38","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"默认与行为","locale":"zh-CN"},"4278":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-39","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"`root`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4279":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-40","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"必填；相对 fs.baseUrl 按目录解析，清除查询和片段","locale":"zh-CN"},"4280":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-41","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"`index`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4281":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-42","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"`[\"index.html\", \"index.htm\"]`，按顺序尝试","locale":"zh-CN"},"4282":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-43","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"`redirect`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4283":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-44","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"true；目录缺少尾斜杠时 301","locale":"zh-CN"},"4284":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-45","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"`extensions`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4285":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-46","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"空；原文件优先，再按顺序尝试扩展名","locale":"zh-CN"},"4286":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-47","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"`exclude`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4287":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-48","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"空；按相对 URL 路径匹配，包含点文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4288":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-49","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"`fallthrough`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4289":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-50","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"false；启用时仅 404 继续后续路由","locale":"zh-CN"},"4290":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-51","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"`disposition`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4291":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-52","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"未配置；可用 inline / attachment","locale":"zh-CN"},"4292":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-53","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"`errorPages`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4293":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-54","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"空；按状态码选择错误页，保留原状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"4294":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-55","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"缺失、非目录、目录和 InvalidPath 对应 404，PermissionDenied 对应 403，其他读取错误为 500。错误页沿用上游独立的解析路径，不套用普通文件的 exclude/containment 或下载 disposition；不要将它误当作与普通请求相同的路径规则。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4295":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-56","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#static","content":"MIME 顺序为内容检测、文件名、octet-stream。固定 file-type 20.5.0 的全部 171 个 MIME 值有真实样本覆盖；检测使用独立可取消流，支持小块数据和跨越首块的容器头。扩展名表与 picomatch 排除规则均有上游对照。attachment 使用 UTF-8 文件名编码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4296":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-57","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#proxy","content":"`ProxyPlugin` / `ProxyConfig` 依赖 `server` 与 `http`，必填 `target` 按目录解析。即使配置 URL 含查询或片段，也在 pathname 上补尾斜杠。解码后的路径逐段重新编码，保留 `+` 和路径段子分隔符；`?`、`#`、`%` 保持为路径内容。规范化后的目标必须仍在同一 origin 和目标目录内；越界 HTTP 返回 400，WS 直接断开且不连接上游、不接受下游。query 以 URLSearchParams 规则编码并替换目标查询。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4297":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-58","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#proxy","content":"HTTP 转发方法与 header，仅 POST/PUT/PATCH 转发 body。原始客户端保留 4xx/5xx，并按 Fetch 重定向规则处理流式 body。解压后的响应移除 content-encoding/content-length。上游核心采用返回 Response 的行为也被保留：自定义 reason 不转发，重复 Set-Cookie 只留下最后一个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4298":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-59","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#proxy","content":"WS 先连接上游再 accept 下游，过滤 Host、Connection、Upgrade、握手 key/version/extensions/accept 和 content-length。文本与二进制双向转发；关闭码 1000 或 3000–4999 原样传递，其他转换为 1000。上游传输错误关闭下游为 1011；握手连接失败不 accept，不自行改成 502。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4299":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-60","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#proxy","content":"`ServerProxy` 的服务键为 `server.proxy`，`public_url()` 从**提供插件的上下文**读取 Server，因此包含它的挂载前缀；后续消费者的 intercept 不改变该 getter。HTTP/Server 替换时 Proxy 按依赖关系重建。普通上游连接失败只影响本次操作，上游恢复后健康 Proxy 实例可继续使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4300":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-61","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#auxiliary","content":"`FsExt` 增加 `base_url`、`resolve`、`file` 和 `mount`；配置 base 与从外到内的每层拦截都视为目录 URL：pathname 以 `/` 结尾，清除 query/fragment，拒绝 `mem:bucket` 等不支持相对解析的 opaque base。因此 `file:///app` → `data` → `logs?x#y` 最终指向 `file:///app/data/logs/`。Windows 绝对盘符路径在输入边界转换为 file URL；未知配置字段仍可保留。最长挂载前缀优先。`LocalFsPlugin` 显式挂载 file:，保留原生 watch 功能。本轮没有扩展 FS 写入/删除/重命名生态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4301":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-62","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#auxiliary","content":"`HttpExt::request` 返回 raw status、reason、headers 和流 body；`WebSocketExt::ws` 提供客户端连接。配置支持 baseUrl、headers、timeout、keepAlive、proxyAgent 和附加 PEM rootCertificates。拦截按上游规则合并，请求 headers 替换配置 headers。超时约束到响应头收到为止；body 仍归调用者生命周期。TLS 使用平台证书验证并可添加信任根，不关闭验证。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4302":{"id":"/docs/reference-server-63","page_id":"/docs/reference-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-server#auxiliary","content":"支持 gzip、deflate（zlib/raw）、Brotli、Zstd 解压，原始响应仍保留压缩 header 供调用方决定转发方式。辅助客户端不覆盖完整 HTTP decoder、file/data URL 或 SOCKS 生态；WS 客户端不提出 permessage-deflate 协商，应用消息语义已对照。生产路径全部为 Rust，Node 仅用于测试上游。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4303":{"id":"/docs/reference-services","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","type":"page","content":"服务与可追溯性","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","Cordis 参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-services","locale":"zh-CN"},"4304":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-0","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services","content":"Cordis 如何借助 Service 基类、tracker 与可追溯代理，把服务方法内部创建的效应归属到调用方纤程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4305":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-1","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-services#problem","content":"它解决的问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"4306":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-2","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-services#service","content":"`Service` 基类","locale":"zh-CN"},"4307":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-3","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"Tracker 与可追溯代理","locale":"zh-CN"},"4308":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-4","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-services#associated-properties","content":"关联属性","locale":"zh-CN"},"4309":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-5","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-services#port","content":"为何这对移植很重要","locale":"zh-CN"},"4310":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-6","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services","content":"本页介绍 `cordis/packages/core/src/service.ts` 与 `utils.ts:113-238`。对应的论文内容是 §5.1.4（上下文访问，见实现）与 §6.3（能力，见讨论与相关工作）。这一机制在论文中大多是*隐含*的，但在实践中对时间可组合性（temporal composability）至关重要。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4311":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-7","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#problem","content":"一个服务（service）由一个纤程（fiber，即提供者（provider））提供，被许多其他纤程（消费者（consumer））调用。当消费者调用例如 `ctx.timer.setTimeout(cb, 100)` 时，它创建的定时器是一个效应（effect），必须**归消费者的纤程所有**。否则，卸载消费者会泄漏该定时器，而卸载提供者会杀死它在概念上并不拥有的定时器。同样，`ctx.logger('x')` 应以调用方插件命名。因此，Cordis 在每次服务调用上区分两个上下文：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4312":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-8","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#problem","content":"位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"4313":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-9","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#problem","content":"是什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"4314":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-10","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#problem","content":"决定","locale":"zh-CN"},"4315":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-11","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#problem","content":"**使用点**（use site）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4316":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-12","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#problem","content":"访问服务时所在的上下文（调用方）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4317":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-13","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#problem","content":"*效应*、*拦截*、*隔离*","locale":"zh-CN"},"4318":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-14","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#problem","content":"**定义点**（def site）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4319":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-15","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#problem","content":"发起访问的代码被定义时所在的上下文（当服务内部的代码运行时，即服务自己的上下文）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4320":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-16","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#problem","content":"*服务解析*（哪些 `inject` 声明允许访问）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4321":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-17","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#service","content":"`service.ts`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4322":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-18","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#service","content":"在插件的 `apply` 中构造 `Service` 即提供它；这次提供是该纤程的一个可撤销效应。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4323":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-19","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#service","content":"`[Service.init]()` 在构造之后由纤程 runner 调用（`fiber.ts:158-165`）；其返回值被当作效应（可以是异步的或生成器）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4324":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-20","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#service","content":"`[Service.check]()` 是一个额外的可用性谓词，供消费者的 `_checkImpl` 查询。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4325":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-21","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#service","content":"`[Service.invoke]` 使服务可被调用（`ctx.logger('name')`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4326":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-22","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#service","content":"`[symbols.filter](ctx)` 是该服务所发出事件的默认领域相等过滤器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4327":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-23","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#service","content":"`[Service.extend](props)` 创建一个派生实例（原型子对象或可调用的克隆）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4328":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-24","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#service","content":"`[Service.mergeIntercept]` / `[Service.resolveIntercept]` 处理拦截元数据（见拦截）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4329":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-25","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#service","content":"`Service[Symbol.hasInstance]` 会遍历构造函数，因为实例可能是代理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4330":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-26","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"任何带有 `[symbols.tracker]` 描述符 `{ property?: 'ctx', associate?: string, noShadow?: boolean }` 的对象，每当从上下文上被读取时，都会被 `getTraceable(ctx, value)` 包装。`createTraceable`（`utils.ts:164-220`）返回一个行为如下的 Proxy：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4331":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-27","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"访问","locale":"zh-CN"},"4332":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-28","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"4333":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-29","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"`value[tracker.property]`（即 `service.ctx`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4334":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-30","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"**使用点**上下文","locale":"zh-CN"},"4335":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-31","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"`value[symbols.caller]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4336":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-32","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"定义点（调用方的定义点）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4337":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-33","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","ur