e]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4347":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-43","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"**影子**上下文（`symbols.shadow`）是一个二元组：对象本身是使用点（其纤程接收效应），其 `shadow` 属性是定义点（代理的 `get` 陷阱在 `locate` 时查询它）。因此，在服务方法内部：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4348":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-44","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"`this.ctx.effect(...)` 与 `this.ctx.on(...)` 被注册到**调用方**纤程中；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4349":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-45","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"`this.ctx.otherService` 按**服务**自己的 `inject`（定义点）解析，即使从根调用也是如此（`shadow.spec.ts: 'applies the service inject when entered from root'`）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4350":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-46","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"`noShadow` 服务（events、logger、reflect、registry）暴露调用方，但不保留影子。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4351":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-47","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"`withProps` / `withProp` 构建只覆盖少数属性的轻量代理；`joinPrototype` 为可调用服务把类原型与 `Function.prototype` 合并；`createCallable` 构建函数对象。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4352":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-48","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#associated-properties","content":"由 `tests/associate.spec.ts` 覆盖。名为 `foo.bar` 的服务（或以 `foo.bar` 提供的属性）可通过 `ctx.foo.bar` 访问。由服务创建的对象（例如 tracker 为 `associate: 'session'` 的 `Session`）会暴露*其他*插件在 `session.*` 下注册的 mixin（`ctx.mixin('bar', { answer: 'session.answer' })`）。可见性遵循声明方纤程（`'associated access follows the service fiber'`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4353":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-49","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"t