` and `fs`","locale":"en"},"6146":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-configuration-10","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-configuration","content":"The `kardia` binary runs the app described by a YAML or JSON config file (`kardia.yml` by default). The file is a list of **entries**. Each entry runs one plugin:","locale":"en"},"6147":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-configuration-11","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-configuration#entry-fields","content":"Field","locale":"en"},"6148":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-configuration-12","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-configuration#entry-fields","content":"Meaning","locale":"en"},"6149":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-configuration-13","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-configuration#entry-fields","content":"`id`","locale":"en"},"6150":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-configuration-14","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-configuration#entry-fields","content":"Identifies the entry across edits. Missing ids are generated, and written to the file with the next write-back.","locale":"en"},"6151":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-configuration-15","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-configuration#entry-fields","content":"`name`","locale":"en"},"6152":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-configuration-16","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-configuration#entry-fields","content":"The plugin. Either a built-in name or a guest module path (see below).","locale":"en"},"6153":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-configuration-17","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-configuration#entry-fields","content":"`config`","locale":"en"},"6154":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-configuration-18","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-configuration","tags