e-example","content":"Without an argument, the binary reads `kardia.yml` from the working directory. See Installation for the requirements.","locale":"en"},"7808":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-9","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#the-example-app","content":"`examples/kardia.yml` is a list of entries, one plugin each:","locale":"en"},"7809":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-10","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#the-example-app","content":"`timer` is the built-in timer service.","locale":"en"},"7810":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-11","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#the-example-app","content":"`hmr` reloads the guest modules below `plugins/` when their files change.","locale":"en"},"7811":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-12","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#the-example-app","content":"`plugins` is a group of two entries: the console logger, disabled for now, and `hello`, a WebAssembly guest plugin written by hand in WebAssembly text (`examples/plugins/hello.wat`).","locale":"en"},"7812":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-13","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#the-example-app","content":"The configuration file explains every field.","locale":"en"},"7813":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-14","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#things-to-try-while-it-runs","content":"**Change the config.** In `examples/kardia.yml`, set `disabled: false` on the `console` entry: the console logger starts. Set it back to `true` and it stops.","locale":"en"},"7814":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-15","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#things-to-try-while-it-runs","content":"**Hot-reload a plugin.** Edit the greeting in `examples/plugins/hello.wat`. The `hmr` entry reloads t