Source`"],[5820,"`DylibSource`"],[4930,"`𝔇Σ := Set(K)`."],[413,"`𝔇Σ := Set(K)`。"],[49,"`e_n` 的一次迭代可以实例化一个组件：它执行 `π = n` 的 O-Insert，并**以新纤程的 O-Retire 作为其逆操作产出**。逆操作*使其退役而不是移除*，因为逆操作必须总是可应用的，而 O-Remove 带有前提（一个 Active 子纤程会阻止它）。一个已退役、Inactive 且为空的条目是*残留的*（vestigial）（引理 62，见元理论）：它与不存在无法区分。使子纤程退役不会让父纤程等待；孙纤程逐层处理。"],[233,"`e`"],[4752,"`e`"],[4543,"`e`: a witnessed **effect iterator** (witnessed up to `≃_{d∪p}`): the effects contributed while active, plus their inverses."],[21,"`e`：一个带见证的**效应迭代器**（在 `≃_{d∪p}` 意义下带见证）：组件激活期间贡献的效应（effect），以及它们的逆操作。"],[215,"`effect(e)`"],[4734,"`effect(e)`"],[4788,"`effect` accepts both effect functions and iterators (ad-hoc polymorphism); the guard is checked at each iteration boundary."],[5119,"`effect` returns an inverse at the next level"],[605,"`effect` 在下一层返回逆操作"],[270,"`effect` 既接受效应函数也接受迭代器（特设多态）；守卫在每个迭代边界处检查。"],[5104,"`effect^iter` lands in the same `∂Γ → ∂²Γ` as `effect`, so **an iterator is an effect** and composes anywhere an effect can (nesting)."],[590,"`effect^iter` 与 `effect` 落在同一个 `∂Γ → ∂²Γ` 中，因此**迭代器就是效应**，凡是能用效应的地方都能组合迭代器（嵌套）。"],[5461,"`EffectHandle::dispose()` returns a `Disposal`, a future of `Result<()>` that can also be dropped; `ready()` returns a future of `Result<()>`. The handle also has `label()`, `is_active()` and `meta()`."],[947,"`EffectHandle::dispose()` 返回一个 `Disposal`，它是 `Result<()>` 的 future，也可以直接丢弃；`ready()` 返回 `Result<()>` 的 future。该句柄还有 `label()`、`is_active()` 和 `meta()`。"],[1844,"`EffectHandle`"],[6358,"`EffectHandle`"],[5467,"`EffectHandle` is a non-owning handle: dropping it does **not** dispose. Component lifetime is dynamic and governed by the fiber, which is exactly where the paper distinguishes Cordis from RAII (§7.3: lexical scoping is complementary, for resources local to one effect; inside a disposer, ordinary `Drop` types are fine)."],[1912,"`EffectHandle` 是**非拥有**的：丢弃它不会释放效应。效应的生命期由它登记所在的纤程决定，这正是论文区分 Cordis 与 RAII 之处。词法作用域是互补的，适用于某个效应内部的局部资源：在撤销函数内部，普通的 `Drop` 类型完全可用。"],[953,"`EffectHandle` 是不持有所有权的句柄：丢弃它**不会**释放。组件的生命周期是动态的，由纤程管理，这恰恰是论文区分 Cordis 与 RAII 之处（§7.3：词法作用域是互补的，适用于单个效应内部的局部资源；在撤销函数内部，普通的 `Drop` 类型完全可以使用）。"],[8009,"`EffectMeta { label, children }` for introspection (`fiber.getEffects()`, used by tooling)."],[1842,"`EffectScope`"],[6356,"`EffectScope`"],[8255,"`emit('internal/commit', fiber, config)` unless `noSave` (the loader writes the config back to its entry);"],[2991,"`emit`"],[3556,"`emit`"],[7505,"`emit`"],[8070,"`emit`"],[5796,"`emit` and `bail` log a panicking listener and continue, `serial` returns its panic as an error, `parallel` collects it (see Dispatching); TS lets a throwing listener abort the dispatch. There is no generic `waterfall`; typed hooks (`on_config`, `on_update`) replace it."],[1282,"`emit` 和 `bail` 记录发生 panic 的监听器并继续，`serial` 把该 panic 作为错误返回，`parallel` 收集它（见派发）；TS 让抛出异常的监听器中止分发。没有通用的 `waterfall`；由带类型的钩子（`on_config`、`on_update`）代替。"],[3845,"`entry.fiber.dispose(); entry.fiber ← ctx.use(import(url), config)`"],[8359,"`entry.fiber.dispose(); entry.fiber ← ctx.use(import(url), config)`"],[3951,"`Entry.update(options, create, force)`"],[8465,"`Entry.update(options, create, force)`"],[3946,"`Entry`"],[8460,"`Entry`"],[7000,"`EntryChange` fields"],[2486,"`EntryChange` 字段"],[8580,"`EntryGroup.update(config)` is **keyed reconciliation**: the union of old and new ids; for each, in parallel (`Promise.all`), `create()` (adopt/update, forced) or `remove()`. Anonymous entries get a unique key, so each is created with a fresh random id. One bad entry does not stop the others."],[4066,"`EntryGroup.update(config)` 是**按键协调**：取新旧 id 的并集；对每个 id 并行（`Promise.all`）执行 `create()`（采用/更新，强制）或 `remove()`。匿名条目获得唯一键，因此每个都以新的随机 id 创建。一个坏条目不会阻止其他条目。"],[7106,"`EntryHandle::init().await` starts an entry if it is not running, or joins its pending start; concurrent callers share one start."],[2592,"`EntryHandle::init().await` 在条目未运行时启动它，或加入其进行中的启动；并发调用者共享同一次启动。"],[5813,"`EntryHandle::init` starts an entry or joins its pending start."],[1299,"`EntryHandle