leanup and cancels on disposal or policy changes. Loader entries expose the same choice through `recovery`; see configuration and examples and native fault evidence. `restart()` still does not clear failure; manual handling uses `update`, while selected supervision drives the supported recovery operation. Unrelated plugins must remain operational under every policy."],[7246,"`Fiber::set_recovery` now selects `Manual` (default), bounded `Retry`, or `Host` handling. The supervisor outlives the failed instance, waits for cleanup and cancels on disposal or policy changes. Loader entries expose the same choice through `recovery`; see configuration and examples and native fault evidence. `restart()` still does not clear failure; manual handling uses `update`, while selected supervision drives the supported recovery operation. Unrelated plugins must remain operational under every policy."],[5280,"`Fiber::set_recovery` now selects `Manual` (default), bounded `Retry`, or `Host` handling. The supervisor outlives the failed instance, waits for cleanup and cancels on disposal or policy changes. Loader entries expose the same choice through `recovery`; see configuration and examples and native fault evidence. `restart()` still does not clear failure; manual handling uses `update`, while selected supervision drives the supported recovery operation. Unrelated plugins must remain operational under every policy. In-process unwind handling cannot contain abort, segfault or process-wide termination. Use existing process/WASM boundaries where needed; native dylibs do not provide crash isolation."],[365,"`Fiber::set_recovery` 已支持 `Manual`（默认）、限频 `Retry` 和 `Host` 处理；监督位于失败实例之外，等待清理，并随释放或策略切换取消。loader 条目通过 `recovery` 提供相同选择，见配置与示例及原生故障证据。`restart()` 仍不清除失败，手动处理使用 `update`，选择监督策略后由监督逻辑驱动恢复操作。每种策略都必须保持无关插件正常运行。"],[1025,"`Fiber::set_recovery` 已支持 `Manual`（默认）、限频 `Retry` 和 `Host` 处理；监督位于失败实例之外，等待清理，并随释放或策略切换取消。loader 条目通过 `recovery` 提供相同选择，见配置与示例及原生故障证据。`restart()` 仍不清除失败，手动处理使用 `update`，选择监督